<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h1">Samw</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu chaka Samweli wa Kabheli</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Samw</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu chaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu yaka 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli pakutumbula hapa chakabhi nde chitabu chimu chikolongwa chechakamanyakini ngati “Chitabu chaka Samweli.” Kwa mala ja kutumbula chitabu chenjenu kuchigabhanya na kubha itabu ibheli chakahengakiki mu litoleu lelakalowakiki, “Litoleu la Septuaginti.” Aleli lakabhi nde litoleu la kutumbula la kutafusili Lulaghilu lwa Mwande mu lugha ja Kiyunani. Lihina la tafusili jeniheji lakatotwili ndandi ja kubha tafusili jeniheji jakalembakiki na bhasomi sabini au sabini na bhabheli bha Kiyahude. Mu tafusili jenjenu ja Kigiliki, itabu yaka 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli yakalowakiki 1 Ngolongwa na 2 Ngolongwa, na mu litoleu la Kilatini lelakajengalili baada ja leniheli, itabu yeniheyi yakang'anambuliwi na kulowakeka 1 Bhakolongwa na 2 Bhakolongwa. Bhela itabu yeimanyikana lalenu ngati 1 Bhakolongwa na 2 Bhakolongwa, mu litoleu leniheli yakalowakiki 3 Bhakolongwa na 4 Bhakolongwa. Itabu yaka 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli ilongalela mambu ghaakahengiki mlota Samweli, nkolongwa Sauli, na nkolongwa Daudi. Samweli akabhi nde chiongozi wa kujomulela wa inchi ja Izilaeli pajakang'anambwiki kuhuma mu kutawaliwa na Bhatemula, na kutumbula kutawaliwa na bhakolongwa. Samweli jojoju nde joakabhapakiki mahuta Sauli na Daudi kwa kubhahimika kubha bhakolongwa bhabheli bha kutumbula bha inchi ja Izilaeli. Itabu yaka 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli ilongalela mambu gha inchi ja Izilaeli mu chikahi chenihechi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Njeta joamanyi kubha nde nane joakailembiki itabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli. Mlemba ngacheakaliloghwili mweni mkati ja itabu yeniheyi, nambu ihobhaleka akabhi mwomi chikahi chokapi cha utawala waka nkolongwa Daudi, na pangi akahighalili kubha mwomi hata baada ja utawala ghonihoghu, na iwezikana kubha akabhi na uwezu wa kubhona na kusoma malembu ghangi ghaghalandili matamu ghaka Sauli na Samweli, kubhokana na hali ja kulepa kumanyikana jejiyongolota utambulishu waka mundu au bhandu bhabhakalembiki itabu yenu, bhelabhela ngacheimanyikana kubha itabu yenu yakalembakiki lile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Daudi moakapati kubha nkolongwa wa Yuda, na panakatai kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli jokapi, mu sula ja 1-5.</para>
  <para style="io">Ntundu Daudi moakatawali ngati nkolongwa, na kubhaweza maadui bhaki bhamaheli, mu sula ja 6-10.</para>
  <para style="io">Daudi moakahengi lihoku la ugoni na kukoma, na ntundu moakalakaliwi na mlota Nasani, mu sula ja 11-12.</para>
  <para style="io">Kupengwa kwa kutumbula na kupengwa kwa kabheli panani jaka Daudi, mu sula ja 13-20.</para>
  <para style="io">Malobhi gha kujomulela gha matamu ghaka Daudi ngati nkolongwa, mu sula ja 22-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Daudi apwaghakika kupotela kwaka Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Paakajomwi kupote Sauli, Daudi paakabhi akelabhuka kuhuma kubhaweza Bhaamaleki, Daudi akatami machobha ghabheli ku Sikilagi hoku. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Lichobha la katatu akahiki mundu joakabhi na ingobhu yeikachwiki na akabhi na luhombi pa mutu jaki kuhuma kulikambi laka Sauli. Paakunhiki Daudi, akachikimi palongi jaki nahuli kumpeke utopelu. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi akundalukile, “Wenga uhumiki kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Najombi akamuyangike, “Ndiliki kuhuma kulikambi la Bhaizilaeli.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daudi akundalukile, “Bho, chipitali kike? Umbwaghilaje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Akapwaghike, “Bhandu bhakatiliki kuhuma ku ngondo. Bhamaheli bhabhu bhakahawiki na kupotela. Najombi Sauli na mwana waki Yonasani bhapotile.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Panihapa Daudi akumpwaghi nkombu jola joakundeti ubholu, “Bho, umanyiki bholi kubha Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki bhatehi kupotela?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Nkombu jola akapwaghike, “Ikapitalili panakabhi panani ja chitombi cha Giliboa, najombi Sauli akabhi konihoku akabya ajeghamakili nkoha waki, na magali gha ngondo na bhajendeha falasi bha upambala wa maadui bhakabhi bhunheghali pambipi nakanopi. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Paakang'anambwiki na kumona, akatehi kunoha. Nanatu nakapwaghike, ‘Nepani, mi pambane.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Akanalukile, ‘Bho, wehapa wa nane?’ Nakamuyangike, ‘Nepani nde Muamaleki.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Bhela akambwaghile, ‘Uheghalya pambani, ungomaje! Mili mumabhinilu makolongwa gha kupotela, hata ngati nakona namwome.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Bhela, nakamuheghalili, na kunkoma, maghambu nakamanyiki kwa uchakaka kubha anaawiki pahi, ngaawezi kulama. Nanatu nakatoliki litaji lela lelakabhi pa mutu jaki na bangili jejakabhi muchiwoku chaki, na nepani nukuletili pambani wa bambo wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Panihapa Daudi papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu naku bhakakamwili ingobhu yabhu na kuikachula kwa mabhinilu. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Bhakaombulizi, bhakaleliki na kukonga kula chilebhi mbaka pakamihe kwa ndandi jaka Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki, na kwa ndandi ja manjolinjoli ghaka Bambo Chapanga na nyumba ja Izilaeli, maghambu bhamaheli bhabhu bhakakomakiki kwa lipanga kungondo.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Bhela, Daudi akumpwaghi nkombu joakundeti ubholu jola, “Bho, wehapa wa mwenehi wa kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Akamuyangike, “Nepani nde mwana waka ngeni, Muamaleki.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Daudi akundalukile, “Bho, maghambu kiki ngachewajowipi kujinula chiwoku chaku na kunkoma mundu joahaghuliwi na Bambo Chapanga?”<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Bhela, Daudi akundohiki jumu wa bhandu bhaki na kumpwaghila, “Ujenda ukunkomaje!” Bhela akundapwi nkombu jola, najombi nkombu jola akapotile. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daudi akumpwaghile, “Ikupalika kupotela kwa lijambu leniheli leupwaghike. Ndandi kwa malobhi ghaku wamwete ghalangihi kubha uhengiki lijambu lihakau, ukapwaghaje, ‘Nunkomiki mundu joahaghuliwi na Bambo Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi aombuleza kwa ndandi jaka Sauli na Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Daudi akaombulizi malelu ghanihagha kwa ndandi jaka Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />najombi akalaghalakili kubha bhandu bha Yuda bhabholakikaje ombulezu leniheli lelilembakiki mu chitabu cha Yashali.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Bhabhabhi ulumbalilu waku, wenga wa Izilaeli, bhakomakiki pa itombi yaku yeijinwike!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Bhandu bhaku bhabhamanyi kukomana wichu bhokapi bhatehi kuhabhuka!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Ngamubhapwaghi bhandu bha muchi wa Gati lijambu leniheli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">ngamwalitangaza haleli mu indela ya Ashikeloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Nanga bhela, anamubhatenda akambomba bha Bhafilisti kubha na chiheku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">na ngamubhaleka akambomba bhangakummanya Chapanga kubha na chiheku.”<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Mwenga itombi ya Giliboa, ngamwikubha na lyangami wala iyula panani jinu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Wala mighonda jinu ngajipambika mahunu gha nhupu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Maghambu konihoku nde ambaku ngau jaka mwana makili jakajeghaliki uhakau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">ngau jaka Sauli ngajipakakiki mahuta kabhete.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Upendi waka Yonasani ngachewakelawiki kunyuma ng'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">lipanga laka Sauli ngachelakelawiki kunyuma waka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">chikahi chokapi yakakomiki bhandu bhamaheli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Ena, yakakomiki bhana makili bha maadui.”<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />“Sauli na Yonasani, bhakapalakiki na bhandu mumatamu ghabhu na kuneng'anela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Ngachebhalekini mu matamu ghabhu, wala mu nyiwa jabhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Bhakajojwiki kupeta ngwahe, na bhakabhi na makili kupeta lihimba.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Mwenga akakamwali bha Izilaeli, ndelaje kwa ndandi jaka Sauli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">Akunhwatiki mwehapa kwa ingobhu ikeli yeibhi na ulumbalilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">na akumpeki mwehapa zahabu ja kuipamba ingobhu hinu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />“Lingalya ntundu bhana makili mobhahabhuki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">bhakomakiki koni bhakabya kungondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Wenga wa Yonasani, ukomakiki, panani ja itombi yeijinwike.”<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />“Umina mtima kwa ndandi jaku, undongu wangu wa Yonasani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">kwangu nepani ukabhi umpalu wangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Upalu waku kwangu ukabhi wa kukangacha namaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">wa kukangacha nakanopi ja upalu wa akambomba.”<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Lingalya ntundu bhana makili mobhahabhukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">na ntundu silaha yabhu ya ngondo moiyonangakile.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ajeghaleka mahuta kubha nkolongwa wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Paghakapetiki mambu ghanihagha, Daudi akundaluki Bambo Chapanga, “Bho, ngwela lelu kujenda ku ghumu wa muchi wa Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Ena, ukwelaje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Daudi akalalukile, “Bho, nyenda kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Bambo Chapanga akayangike, “Ujenda ku Hebuloni.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Bhela, Daudi akakweliki kujenda ku Hebuloni, papamu na akabhahanu bhaki bhabheli, Ahinoamu wa ku muchi wa Yezileeli, na Abigaili, joakahweliwi na ndomi waki Nabali, wa ku muchi wa Kalimeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Bhelabhela Daudi akabhatoliki bhandu bhabhakabhi papamu naku, kila jumu na bhandu bha munyumba jaki, na bhombi bhakatami ku michi ja Hebuloni hoku. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Panihapa bhandu bha ku Yuda bhakahikiki ku Hebuloni, konihoku bhakunjeghi Daudi mahuta akubha nkolongwa wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Daudi paakapwaghakiki kubha bhandu bha ku Yebeshi Gileadi nde bhabhuntaghiki Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />akatumiki bhabholu kwa bhandu bha ku Yebeshi Galeadi, na kubhapwaghila, “Bambo Chapanga ampengalyaje kwa kulangiha wamboni aghoghu wa kuntagha Sauli, bambo winu. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Henu Bambo Chapanga na andangiha wamboni na ulongwana, na nepani nanatu ananuntendila wamboni ghonihoghu kubhokana na lijambu aleli lentendike. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Henu, nkangamalaje na mkubha na makili, maghambu Sauli, bambo winu, apotile, na bhandu bha Yuda bhanyeghi nepani mahuta ngubha nunkolongwa wabhu.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti ahimikwa kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Chikahi chenihechi Abineli mwana waka Neli, nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli ghaka Sauli, akabhi antoliki Ishibosheti, mwana waka Sauli, kundomboha nkoka Yoludani, na kumpeleka mbaka ku muchi wa Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Konihoku, Abineli akunhimiki Ishibosheti kubha nkolongwa wa inchi ja Gileadi, Asheli, Yezileeli, Efulaimu, Benyamini na Izilaeli jokapi. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli akabhi na umule wa hyaka alobaini chikahi paakatumbwi kujitawala inchi ja Izilaeli, najombi akatawili kwa hyaka ibheli. Nambu bhandu bha likabila la Yuda bhakunjengali Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Chikahi ambachu Daudi akabhi nkolongwa panani ja bhandu bha likabila la Yuda ku Hebuloni hoku chakabhi hyaka saba na myehi sita.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondo pachilanda ja bhandu bha Izilaeli na bhandu bha Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abineli mwana waka Neli, papamu na bhatumika bhaka Ishibosheti, mwana waka Sauli, bhakabhokiki ku Mahanaimu, na kujenda ku Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoabu mwana wa Seluya, na bhatumika bhaka Daudi bhakabhokiki na kuhimangana na Abineli papamu na bhandu bhaakabhi nabhu ku litanda lelibhi ku Gibeoni. Lipogha limu lakatami upambala ghumu wa litanda na lipogha lengi lakatami upambala wa kabheli.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Bhela Abineli akumpwaghi Yoabu, “Tubhabheka akakombu bhakumu bhakomana bheni kwa bheni palongi jitu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Yoabu akapwaghike, “Haya, na bhatenda bhenibhela.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Bhela akakombu ishilini na ncheche bhakabhalangike: Upambala wa likabila laka Benyamini na Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli, akakombu komi na bhabheli, na upambala waka Daudi akakombu komi na bhabheli. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Bhela kila mundu akakamulini na njaki kumutu, na kuhomikana mapanga mwindeta. Bhokapi bhabheli bhakahawiki pahi, koni bhakabya bhapotile. Bhela, pandu panihapa pakalowakiki Helikati Hazulimu, yani “Ngonda wa Mapanga. Pandu panihapa pabhi ku Gideoni.”<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Lichobha leniheli ngondo jakabhi ngolongwa namaa, najombi Abineli na bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakalepalili palongi ja bhandu bhaka Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Bhana bhatatu bhaka Seluya bhakabhi konihoku: Yani Yoabu, Abishai na Asaheli. Bhela Asaheli hoju akabhi na imbelu ngati mbabhala. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asaheli akuntopwi Abineli, panga kung'anambuka kumalelelu wala kumangeja chikahi paakabhi antopola. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Bhela Abineli akalingalili kunyuma na kumbona Asaheli, na kundalukila, “Bho, wehapa le wa Asaheli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Jombi akayangiki, “Ena.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Bhela Abineli akumpwaghile, “Ng'anambukaje upambala wa kumalelelu au kumangeja. Untola jumu wa akakombu bha chikambaku na unhula silaa yaki.” Nambu Asaheli ngachekakotwiki kuntopola. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abineli akundakali kabhete Asaheli, na kumpwaghila, “Ukotuka kundopola! Bho, maghambu kiki unyomalake kukukoma? Bho, ananhweza bholi kundingalila ndongu waku Yoabu kumihu?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Nambu Asaheli akakaniki kukotoka kuntopola, bhela Abineli akunhomiki Asaheli palutumbu kwa nkoha waki wangakuhongoka cha kunyuma, nkoha ukunhotwili na kupitali kungongu jaki. Bhela Asaheli akahawiki na kupote pala pala. Bhandu bhokapi pabhakahiki pandu paakabhi apotili Asaheli, bhakajemiki chinunu.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Nambu Yoabu na Abishai bhakunjengali Abineli, na lyobha palakabhi lijibhila, bhakahikiki kuchitombi cha Ama, pambipi na Gia, ku indela jejijenda ku chingwenji cha Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Bhela bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini bhakalibhongini kabheti kunyuma jaka Abineli. Bhakalenganaki lipogha limu, na kujema panani ja chitombi. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Bhela Abineli akundohiki Yoabu, na kumpwaghila, “Bho, anatukomana le machobha ghokapi? Bho, ngacheubhona kubha ujomukelu waki anaukubha mabhinilu? Bho, anaujendalya kwa chikahi bholi pangakubhakanakila bhandu bhaku bhakotuka kubhajengalela bhalongu bhabho?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoabu akayangike, “Chakaka ngati moatami Chapanga, ngati ukabhi ngacheupwaghiki lijambu leniheli, bhandu bhangu bhakabya bhajendali kubhajengali bhalongu bhabhu mbaka chilabhu lukela.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Bhela, Yoabu akalapwi lipenenga, na bhandu bhokapi bhakajemiki, na kukotoka kubhajengalela bhandu bha Izilaeli, wala ngachebhajendali kukomana kabhete.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Ikilu jela Abineli na bhandu bhaki bhokapi bhakajendiki kwa kupetela ku libondi la Alaba. Bhakalombwiki nkoka Yoludani, na kujendalela kwa kupetela inchi jokapi ja Bitiloni, na kuhika ku Mahanaimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Bhela, Yoabu akakelawiki kuhuma kunjengale Abineli, na kubhabhongana bhandu bhaki bhokapi. Papamu na Asaheli, bhandu bhangi komi na tisa bhaka Daudi bhakabhi bhapotile. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Nambu bhandu bhaka Daudi bhakabhi bhabhakomiki bhandu mia itatu na sitini bha likabila laka Benyamini, bhabhakabhi papamu na Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Yoabu na bhandu bhaki bhakajitoliki hyegha jaka Asaheli, na kujenda kuutagha ku litengeli laka tati waki, lelibhi ku Beselehemu hoku. Bhela Yoabu na bhandu bhaki bhakajendiki ikilu jokapi, na pakukachile bhakabhi bhahikiki ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Bhela kukabhi na ngondo ja chikahi chilachu pachilanda ja bhandu bha munyumba jaka Sauli na bhandu bha munyumba jaka Daudi. Nambu Daudi akajendalili kuneng'anela nakanopi, na upambala waka Sauli ukajendali kulepa kubha na makili nakanopi.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhabhakabhelakiki na Daudi ku muchi wa Hebuloni hoku: Mbelakeka waki wa kutumbula akabhi Aminoni, mabhu waki akalowakiki Ahinoamu, kuhuma ku muchi wa Yezileeli. <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Mbelakeka waki wa kabheli akabhi Danieli, mabhu waki akalowakiki Abigaili, joakaweliwi na ndomi Nabali, kuhuma ku muchi wa Kalimeli. Wa katatu akabhi Abisalomu, mabhu waki akalowakiki Maaka, mwali waka Talimai nkolongwa wa ku Geshuli. <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Wa kachechi akabhi Adoniya, mabhu waki akalowakiki Hagiti, na wa kahanu akabhi Shefatia, mabhu waki akalowakiki Abitali. <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />Wa sita akabhi Itileamu, mabhu waki akalowakiki Egila, nhwanu waka Daudi. Bhanihabha nde bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Daudi bhabhakabhabheliki chikahi paakabhi atama ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli alilomba na Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Chikahi ngondo pachilanda ja bhandu bha munyumba jaka Sauli na bhandu bha munyumba jaka Daudi pajakabhi jijendalela, Abneliakabhi ajendale kulijonjuke makili kwa bhandu bha munyumba jaka Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Bhela Sauli akabhi na mtumika jumu wa chimbomba, lihina laki akalowakiki Lisipa, mwali waka Aya. Najombi Ishibosheti akundaluki Abineli, “Bho, maghambu kiki ughoni na mtumika wa chimbomba waka tati wango?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abineli akayomiki namaa kubhokana na malobhi ghaka Ishibosheti, najombi akapwaghike, “Bho, uholake le nepani nhweza kung'anambuka Sauli? Bho, uholake le nepani nabhatumaki bhandu bha Yuda? Lingalyaje, Nepani mili nundongwana kwaka Sauli, bhalongu bhaki, na bhakochi bhaki, na ngachenukutendiki wehapa ukamulika na Daudi mbaka lalenu. Hata bhela, lalenu umona nepani kubha mi na lihakau kwa ndandi jaka mbomba! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Chapanga na andendila nepani Abineli bhenibhela, na kujonjukeka, ngati nepani nganhengi chela Bambo Chapanga cheandaghi Daudi kwa kulapa, <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />kwa kuubhoha ukolongwa kuhuma mu nyumba jaka Sauli, na kuchihimika chitehu chaka Daudi panani ja Izilaeli, na panani ja Yuda, kutumbu ku muchi wa Dani mbaka ku muchi wa Beeli Sheba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishibosheti ngecheakalengiki kupwagha lilobhi lengi kwaka Abineli, maghambu akunjowipi Abineli.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Bhela, Abineli akabhatumiki bhabholu kwa ndandi jaki kwaka Daudi, kumpwaghila, “Bho, inchi ajeji jaka nane? Utenda majonganu na nepani, nanatu ananukujangatya kubhatenda bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakubha upambala waku.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daudi akapwaghike, “Wichu, anandenda majonganu na wehapa, nambu mbala lijambu limu lembala unhengila kuhuma kwako: Ngawihika kuhimangana na nepani mbaka unetila Mikali, mwali waka Sauli, chikahi pawikubha uhika kumona nepani.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Bhela Daudi akapeliki bhabholu kwaka Ishibosheti, mwana waka Sauli, akapwaghaje, “Umbekya nhwanu wangu Mikali, jonakuntowili kwa magovi mia jimu gha Bhafilisti.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Bhela, Ishibosheti akalaghalaki kubha Mikali atolakikaje kuhuma kwaka Palitieli ndomi waki, joakabhi mwana waka Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Palitieli ndomi waki akapiti papamu na nhwanu waki koni alela mu indela jokapi mbaka ku Bahulimu. Bhela, Abineli akumpwaghi Palitieli, “Ubhuja kunyumba.” Bhela najombi akabhujike. <verse eid="2SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Bhela Abineli akapiti kubhapwaghi lijambu leniheli ihongozi bha Izilaeli, akapwaghaje, “Kwa chikahi chilachu mkabhi mpala Daudi akubha nkolongwa winu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Henu, ntenda bhenibhela! Maghambu Bambo Chapanga akundaghi Daudi, akapwaghaje, ‘Kwa kupete Daudi mtumika wangu, ananabhakengalya bhandu bhangu bha Izilaeli kuhuma mu makili gha Bhafilisti, na kuhuma mu makili gha maadui bhabhu bhangi bhokapi.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Bhelabhela Abineli mweni akalongi na bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini, bhela akapiti mbaka ku Hebuloni kumpwaghi Daudi kubhokana na ghala ambaghu bhandu bha Izilaeli na bhandu bha likabila lokapi laka Benyamini ghabhajetangani kuhenga.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Bhela, Abineli akapiti kwaka Daudi ku muchi wa Hebuloni hoku koni akabya na bhandu ishilini. Najombi Daudi akuntendi uwangalalu Abineli, papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu naku. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Bhela Abineli akumpwaghi Daudi, “Sajenu uneka nepani nyenda nakakuletila wehapa wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli. Anabhahika na kutenda majetanganelu na wehapa, nahuli ukubha nkolongwa wabhu, nanau anaubhatawala bhokapi ngati moupalila.” Najombi Daudi akundaghi Abineli, najombi akapiti kwa lukwali.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoabu ankoma Abineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Chikahi chelachela, bhandu bhaka Daudi na Yoabu bhakakelawiki kuhuma kukomana, nabhombi bhakakelawiki na hindu yamaheli namaa yebhaitoliki kwa makili. Nambu Abineli ngacheakabhi kabheti na Daudi ku muchi wa Hebuloni hoku, maghambu Daudi akabhi ajomwi kundaghi ajendaje, najombi akapiti kwa lukwale. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Chikahi Yoabu na manjolinjoli bhokapi bhaakabhi nabhu pabhakakelawiki, akapwaghakiki kubha Abineli, mwana waka Neli, akahikiki kumbona nkolongwa Daudi, najombi andaghi ajendaje, najombi apiti kwa lukwale. <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Bhela Yoabu akapiti kwaka nkolongwa Daudi, na kumpwaghila, “Bho, henu uhengiki chindu bhole? Lingalya, Abineli akahikiki kwaku, maghambu kiki undekiki abhokaje? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Umanyi kubha Abineli, mwana waka Neli, akahikiki nahuli kukukolowa, na kuluchunguza lujendu lwaku, na kumanya kila chindu cheuchihenga!”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Bhela Yoabu paakajomwi kulonge na Daudi, akatumiki bhabholu bhunjengalya Abineli, nabhombi bhakunkelawihi kuhuma ku chilibha cha Sila. Nambu Daudi ngacheakalimanyi lijambu lenihele. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Bhela, Abineli paakakelawiki ku muchi wa Hebuloni, Yoabu akuntoliki na kujenda naku punkeghi ja ndyangu ukolongwa, nahuli kulonge naku kwa pakanjika jabhu. Panihapa Yoabu akunhomiki Abineli nkoha mulutumbu na kupotela pala pala, maghambu Abineli akabhi ankomiki Asaheli. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Panakatai Daudi paakajowili kubhokana na lijambu leniheli, akapwaghike, “Nepani na ukolongwa wangu ngachetubhi na lihoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, kubhokana na kukomakeka kwaka Abineli, mwana waka Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Lihakau la kunkoma mundu jonihoju na likubha panani jaka Yoabu, na panani ja bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaka tati waki! Chikahi chokapi bhandu bha munyumba jaka Yoabu ngabhilepa kubha na mundu joalwala chitamu cha kupita uwila, na chitamu cha malohi au mundu joajenda kwa kutegame mbehu au joakomakeka kwa lipanga, au mundu joalepa kubha na chilebhi!” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Bhela, Yoabu na ndongu waki Abishai, bhakunkomiki Abineli, maghambu Abineli akunkomiki ndongu wabhu Asaheli ku ngondo ja ku muchi wa Gibeoni hoku.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Bhela, Daudi akumpwaghi Yoabu, papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhaakabhi nabhu Yoabu, “Nkachulana ingobhu hinu, na muwata ingobhu ya magunila, na mukaombuliza kwa ndandi jaka Abineli.” Chikahi cha kutagha, nkolongwa Daudi akajendiki kunyuma ja lisanduku. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Bhela bhakuntaghiki Abineli ku Hebuloni hoku, najombi nkolongwa Daudi akaleliki kwa sauti ngolongwa panani ja litengeli laka Abineli, na bhandu bhokapi bhelabhela bhakalelike. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Nkolongwa akajembiki nyembu ajeji kwa ndandi ja kumuombuleze Abineli:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:33">“Bho, maghambu kiki Abineli akapotili ngati moapotale mundu ng'ang'a?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Mabhoku ghaku ngacheghakongakike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">na magholu ghaku ngacheghakongakike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Apotili ngati mundu joakomakiki na bhandu bhahakau!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:34" />
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">Nabhombi bhandu bhokapi bhakundeli kabhete.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Bhela bhandu bhokapi bhakapiti kumpembalake Daudi nahuli akula chilebhi, chikahi pakukabhi kukali muhi. Nambu Daudi akalapiki, akapwaghaje, “Chapanga na angomaje ngati ananguliki chilebhi au chindu chokapi chela mbaka lyobha palijibhalaje!” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Bhandu bhokapi bhakalilolakili lijambu leniheli, nabhombi bhakaliweni kubha nde lijambu lamboni, ngati mobhakabhoni kubha ghamboni mambu ghangi ghokapi ghaakatendiki nkolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Bhela mu lichobha lenilela bhandu bhokapi, na Bhaiziaeli bhokapi bhakamanyiki kubha nkolongwa ngacheankomiki Abineli, mwana waka Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Bhela nkolongwa akabhapwaghi bhandu bhaki, “Bho, ngachemmanyi kubha lalenu mundu jumu nkolongwa, na joamanyakini apotili mu Izilaeli? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Nanatu lalenu hata ngati mbakiki mahuta kubha nunkolongwa, lalenu nepani ngachemi na makili. Bhana bhaka Seluya abhabha bhambetiki makili. Bambo Chapanga na andepa mundu joahengiki mahakau aghagha kulengana na matendu ghaki mahakau!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Kukomakeka kwaka Ishibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Bhela Ishibosheti mwaka waka Sauli, paakajowini kubha Abineli akomakiki ku Hebuloni hoku, akahekatiki mtima, na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakabhi na choghohi namaa. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Bhela Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli, akabhi na bhandu bhabheli bhabhakabhi ihongozi bha ikosi ya manjolinjoli. Jumu akalowakiki Baana, na jongi akalowakiki Lekabu, bhana bhaka Limoni, mundu wa likabila laka Benyamini, kuhuma ku muchi wa Beeloti, ndandi muchi wa Beeloti bhelabhela ukabhi mali gha likabila laka Benyamini. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Kukabhi bhandu bha ku muchi wa Beeloti bhakatilili ku muchi wa Gitaimu, na bhakatami konihoku ngati bhagheni mbaka lichobha la lalenu.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Najombi Yonasani, mwana waka Sauli akabhi na mwana wa chikambaku joakabhi na chilema cha magholu ghaki ghokapi ghabheli. Mwana jonihoju akalowakiki Mefibosheti. Mefibosheti akabhi na hyaka nhwanu chikahi malobhi gha kupotela kwaka Sauli na Yonasani paghakajowaniki kuhuma ku Yezileeli. Ikapitali kubha mundu joakabhi angoha paakajowini kubha Sauli na Yonasani bhakomakiki ku Yezilaeeli hoku, akuntoliki Mefibosheti na kutila naku. Nambu paakabhi atila naku kwa manyata, mwana hoju akahawiki na kubha na chilema.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Bhela, Lekabu na Baana, bhana bhaka Limoni, kuhuma ku muchi wa Beeloti, bhakapiti kunyumba jaka Ishibosheti, nabhombi bhakahikiki konihoku muhi, chikahi Ishibosheti paakabhi apomulili panyumba jaki. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Bhakajingili mu chumba cha mkati ngati bhajenda kutola inganu, na kunhomeka Ishibosheti nkoha palutumbu jaki. Bhela pabhakajomwi kunkoma bhenibhela, Lekabu na ndongu waki Baana bhakatilike. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Bhakabhi bhajingili mkati ja nyumba chikahi Ishibosheti paakabhi aghoni pachitanda, muchumba chaki. Pabhakunhomiki nkoha na kunkoma, bhakunhekiti mmutu waki. Bhakautoliki mmutu hoghu, na kujenda nau ikilu jokapi kwa kupetela indela ja libondi la Alaba. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Bhakautoliki mmutu waka Ishobosheti ghola na kundete Daudi ku mchi wa Hebuloni hoku. Nabhombi bhakumpwaghi nkolongwa Daudi, “Lingalyaje, aghoghu nde mmutu waka Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli, adui waku, joakabhi apala kughayonanga matamu ghaku. Lichobha la lalenu Bambo Chapanga akulepili chisasi wa bambo wangu unkolongwa, kwa ndandi jaka Sauli na bhabhelakeka bhaki.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Nambu Daudi akabhayangiki Lekabu na ndongu waki Baana, bhana bhaka Limoni, kuhuma ku muchi wa Beeloti, akapwaghaje, “Chakaka napa kwaka Bambo Chapanga joabhi mwomi, kubha jombi nde joangengalili matamu ghangu kubhokana na mang'ahiku ghokapi. <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Mundu jola joakahiki kumbwaghi kubha Sauli akomakiki, koni akaholakya kubha anete ubholu wamboni, nakunkamwili na kunkoma ku muchi wa Sikilagi hoku. Ghonihoghu ukabhi nde nhupu ghonakumpekihi kubhokana na ubholu waki ghoanetile. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Bho, anakubhi bhandu bhahakau bhunkomiki mundu wamboni koni akabya pachitanda chaki, munyumba jaki, bho, nga wichu lelu kwangu nepani kundepe chisasi kwa kunkoma mundu joahengiki bhenibhela, na kumboha pani pundema?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Bhela Daudi akabhalaghalaki bhandu bhaki, nabhombi bhakabhakomike. Bhakahekiti mabhoku ghabhu, na magholu ghabhu, na kuijenjeha hyegha yabhu pambipi na litanda la ku muchi wa Hebuloni hoku. Nambu bhakautoliki mmutu waka Ishobosheti na kuutagha palitengeli laka Abineli ku muchi wa Hebuloni hoku.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli na Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 11:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Bhela bhandu bha makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli bhakunjendi Daudi ku muchi wa Hebuloni hoku, na kumpwaghila, “Tepani nde ihupa yaku na mwahi waku. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Pamwandi hapa, chikahi Sauli paakabhi nkolongwa witu, wehapa nde weubhalonguha bhandu bha Izilaeli kungondo. Najombi Bambo Chapanga akakupwaghile, ‘Wehapa anaubhalonguha bhandu bhangu Izilaeli, na anaukubha unkolongwa panani ja Izilaeli.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Ihongozi bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakunjendi nkolongwa Daudi ku muchi wa Hebuloni hoku, najombi nkolongwa akatendiki lulaghilu nabhu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nabhombi bhakunjeghi Daudi mahuta nahuli akubha nkolongwa Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Daudi akabhi na hyaka selasini chikahi paakabhi atumbu kutawala, na akatawili kwa chikahi cha hyaka alobaini. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Akatami ku muchi wa Hebuloni koni kwa hyaka saba na nusu koni akajitawala Yuda, na akatami ku muchi wa Yelusalemu kwa hyaka selasini na itatu koni akajitawala Izilaeli jokapi na Yuda jokapi.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Bhela nkolongwa na bhandu bhakapiti ku muchi wa Yelusalemu kubhalapu Bhayebusi bhabhakabhi bhenehi bhatama monihomu. Nambu bhombi bhakumpwaghile, “Ngaujingili mu muchi ghoni, ndandi hata akangalola na iwete anabhakutopulya kutali.” Bhakumpwaghi bhenibhela maghambu bhakaholaki kubha Daudi ngacheaweza kujingi monihomu. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Hata bhela, Daudi akajitoliki kwa makili ngomi ja Sayuni, jejakamanyakini ngati muchi waka Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Mu lichobha leniheli, Daudi akapwaghike, “Mundu jokapi jola joanaabhalapula Bhayebusi, apetila ku nkolulela wa machi nahuli kubhalapu ilema na akangalola, ambabhu roho jangu jitenda kubhahakalila.” Nde ndandi bhandu bhapwagha, “Akangalola na iwete ngabhijingi mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Bhela Daudi akatami mu ngomi jeniheji, na kujiloha, “Muchi waka Daudi.” Bhela Daudi akauchengiki muchi kujiyongolota ngomi jeniheji, akachengiki kutumbu ku Milo kujenda mkati ja muchi. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Daudi akajonjukiki kuneng'anela nakanopi, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa manjolinjoli, akabhi papamu naku.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Bhela, nkolongwa Hilamu wa ku muchi wa Tilo akabhatumiki bhabholu kwaka Daudi, bhelabhela akumpelaki mielezi, maselemala na bhachenga, ambabhu bhakunchengi Daudi nyumba ja kikolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Najombi Daudi akamanyiki kubha Bambo Chapanga antendiki kubha nkolongwa panani ja Izilaeli, na aukwehiki ukolongwa waki kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhaki, Izilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Bhela chikahi Daudi paakajomwi kubhoka ku muchi wa Hebuloni, akabhatoliki bhatumika bha chimbomba nakanopi na akabhahanu kuhuma ku Yelusalemu hoku. Bhanihabha bhakumbelaki Daudi bhana bhamaheli bha chikambaku na bhana bha chimbomba. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Aghagha nde mahina gha bhana bha chikambaku, bhabhakumbelaki akabhahanu bhaki ku muchi wa Yelusalemu hoku: Shamua, Shobabu, Nasani, Solomoni, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />na Ibihali, Elishua, Nefegi, Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />na Elishama, Eliada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi abhaweza Bhafilisti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 14:8-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Bhela Bhafilisti pabhakajowini kubha Daudi ajeghaliki mahuta kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, bhakabhokiki bhokapi papamu na manjolinjoli ghabhu kujenda kundonda, nambu Daudi akajowini malobhi ghanihagha, najombi akahelili kujenda kujingi mu ngomi. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Bhela Bhafilisti bhakahikiki na kughabhanika ku libondi la Bhalefai. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Bhela, Daudi akundaluki Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Bho, nyenda lelu nakabhalapula Bhafilisti? Bho, anaunyangatya le kubhaweza?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Bambo Chapanga akayangike, “Ena, ujenda ukabhalapulaje, ndandi chakaka ananukujangatya ubhaweza Bhafilisti!”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Bhela, Daudi akapiti mbaka ku Baali Pelasimu, na konihoku akabhaweziki Bhafilisti. Panihapa akapwaghike, “Bambo Chapanga apetiki pachilanda ja maadui bhangu ngati mafuliku gha machi ghaghajenda kwa makili.” Bhela pandu panihapa pakalowakiki Baali Pelasimu, yani Bambo Chapanga wa mafuliku. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Bhafilisti bhakailekiki imong'umong'u yabhu konihoku, najombi Daudi na bhandu bhaki bhakaibhokili kutali.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Bhela Bhafilisti bhakakweliki kwa mala ja kabheli, na kughabhanika mu libondi la Bhalefai. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Bhela Daudi akundaluki kabhete Bambo Chapanga, najombi Bambo Chapanga akayangike, “Ngawijenda kwa kubhoke pandu paubhile, nambu ubhayongaluta kwa kunyuma jabhu, na ukabhalapulaje kwa palongi ja mikongu ja mifolosadi. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Chikahi pela pawijowana sauti ja nganyatu kuhuma kunani ja mikongu ja mifolosadi, ujenda manyata, maghambu jeniheji anajilangiha kubha Bambo Chapanga alongulili palongi jaku kubhalapu manjolinjoli gha Bhafilisti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Bhela Daudi akatendiki ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile, najombi akabhalapwi Bhafilisti mu indela jokapi kutumbu ku muchi wa Geba mbaka ku muchi wa Gezeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku la Lulaghilu liletakeka ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:6">15:25-16:6,43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Bhela Daudi akabhabhongini kabhete manjolinjoli bha Izilaeli, bhokapi bhakabhi elufu selasini. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Daudi akabhokiki na kujenda papamu na bhandu bhaki bhokapi bhaakabhi nabhu ku Baala Yuda, na kujenda kulitola Lisanduku laka Chapanga kuhuma konihoku, lelilowakeka kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga wa manjolinjoli joatama panani ja ihumbi yeibhi na mapapanila panani ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Bhela, bhakalitoliki Lisanduku laka Chapanga heli kuhuma ku nyumba jaka Abinadabu, jejibhi ku itombi, na kulitotola kwa ligali la kuhutakika lahenu. Uza na Ahio bhana bhaka Abinadabu nde bhabhakabhi bhalijendesha ligali la kuhutakika heli. <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />Bhakalibhohiki ligali la kuhutakika heli kuhuma panyumba jaka Abinadabu jejibhi ku itombi, papamu na Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga. Ahio nde joakalongulili palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daudi na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, bhakabhi bhajemba nyembu na kukina kwa makili ghabhu ghokapi, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Bhakabhi bhalapu lilimba, zeze, matali, kayamba na matoazi.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Pabhakahikiki pa lubhanja lwa kupumundila mahunu lwa ku Nakoni, Uza akahatambwi chiwoku chaki na kulikamu Lisanduku laka Chapanga, maghambu ng'ombi yeyakabhi ilihuta ligali heli yakatehi kulikobhandola. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akabhi na inyela namaa kwa ndandi ja chihengu cheakahengiki Uza cha kulepa kubha na utopelu, panihapa Bambo Chapanga akundapwi na kupotela pala pala punkeghi ja Lisanduku laka Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Najombi Daudi akayomiki kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga akundapwi Uza kwa inyela. Bhela, pandu panihapa pakalowakiki “Pelesi Uza,” yani “Malapuliku ghaka Uza,” mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Bhela mu lichobha leniheli Daudi akunjowipi Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Bho, henu Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga analinhikila bhole?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Bhela, Daudi ngacheakapaliki kabhete kulileta Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga kwaki mu muchi waka Daudi, nambu Daudi akalipeliki ku nyumba jaka Obedi Edomu, kuhuma ku muchi wa Giti. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga heli lakatami mu nyumba jaka Obedi Edomu kwa myehi jitatu, najombi Bambo Chapanga akumpengali Obedi Edomu, papamu na bhandu bha munyumba jaki.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Bhela nkolongwa Daudi paakapwaghakiki kubha Bambo Chapanga abhapengali bhandu bha munyumba jaka Obedi Edomu na hindu yokapi yeakabhi nayu kwa ndandi ja Lisanduku laka Chapanga, akapiti kulitola Lisanduku laka Chapanga kuhuma kunyumba jaka Obedi Edomu, na kulipeleka ku muchi waka Daudi kwa chiheku. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Bhandu bhala bhabhakalitotwi Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga kila pabhakabhi bhajenda hatua sita, Daudi akabhohiki nyambiku ja likambaku limu la ng'ombi na litoli lelinonike. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Daudi akakiniki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kwa makili ghaki ghokapi, koni akabya awati chizibau cha ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Bhela, Daudi na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakalipeliki Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga mbaka ku muchi waka Daudi kwa chiheku, na kwa sauti ngolongwa ja mapenenga.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Bhela, chikahi Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga palakabhi lijingi mu muchi waka Daudi, Mikali mwali waka Sauli akalingali palidilisha. Najombi paakumbweni nkolongwa Daudi ahomba homba na kukina palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, akunjojwi muntima waki. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Bhela bhakalijingihi Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga mkati ja Lihema leakalenganaki Daudi pandu panihapa, na kulibheka pandu paki. Najombi Daudi akabhohiki nyambiku ya kujochakeka na nyambiku ya kutama kwa lukwali palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Daudi paakajomwi kubhoha nyambiku ya kujochakeka na nyambiku ya kutama kwa lukwali, akabhapengali bhandu kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga wa manjolinjoli. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Bhela akabhaghabhili bhandu bhokapi, na lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli, akanalomi na akambomba, kila mundu libumunda la inganu, chipandi cha inyama, na libumunda la zabibu. Panakatai, bhandu bhokapi bhakabhokiki na kubhuja kila mundu kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Bhela Daudi paakakelawiki kunyumba jaki nahuli kubhapengale bhandu bha munyumba jaki, Mikali mwali waka Sauli, akapiti kunjopalela, akapwaghaje, “Ngangachu jaka nkolongwa kwa kulepa kulitopela lalenu, kwa kuliyekula utopu waki palongi ja bhatumika bhaki bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, ngati mundu jwangakubha na utopelu moahuli ingobhu yaki palongi ja bhandu panga iyoni!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daudi akumpwaghi Mikali, “Nakabhi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga joakanhawi nepani pandu paka tati waku, na bhandu bha munyumba jaki, chikahi paakanhawili kubha chiongozi wa bhandu bha Izilaeli, bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga. Bhela nepani anangina pela palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Anangubha wangakubha na utopelu nakanopi ja momeli sajenu. Wehapa anaumona kubha nepani nga chindu, nambu bhatumika bha chimbomba bhaubhapwaghiki abha anabhandopilaje!”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Bhela, Mikali mwali waka Sauli, ngacheakabhi na mwana mbaka kupotela kwaki.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Ulota waka Nasani kwa ndandi jaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 17:1-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Bhela chikahi nkolongwa Daudi paakabhi atama mu nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa, Bambo Chapanga akunjangati kubha na lukwali kubhokana na maadui bhaki ipambala yokapi. <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />Nkolongwa Daudi akumpwaghi Nasani, “Lingalyaje, nepani ndama mu nyumba ja kikolongwa ja mikongu ja mielezi, nambu Lisanduku laka Chapanga litama mu lihema!”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Bhela Nasani akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Lijambu lokapi lela leubhi nalu muntima waku, ujenda ukahengaje, maghambu Bambo Chapanga abhi papamu na wehapa.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Nambu ikilu ghola ghola Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Nasani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Ujenda ukumpwaghila mtumika wangu Daudi, ‘Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, bho, wehapa le anaunjengila nepani nyumba nahuli ndama mkati jake? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Kwa ndandi kutumbu lichobha lenakabhabhohiki bhandu bha Izilaeli kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili nepani ngachendami mu nyumba mbaka lalenu. Nambu mili nakajenda kuhuma pandu pamu mbaka pandu pangi koni nakabya ndama mkati ja lihema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Pandu pokapi pala panakapiti na bhandu bha Izilaeli bhokapi, bho, nabhali le kundaluki chiongozi wabhu jokapi jola, jonundaghalaki kubhadima bhandu bhangu Izilaeli, maghambu kiki ngacheunjengi nyumba ja mielezi?’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Henu, umpwaghila mtumika wangu Daudi, nepani Bambo Chapanga wa manjolinjoli mbwagha anana, ‘Nakakubhohiki wehapa kuhuma mu kudima mambeleli, nahuli ukubha chiongozi wa bhandu bhangu Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kutumbu chikahi chenihechi mili papamu na wehapa pokapi paujenda, na nabhayoningi maadui bhaku bhokapi palongi jaku. Bhela ananilitenda lihina laku kubha likolongwa ngati mahina gha bhandu bhangi bhabhabhi bhakolongwa pundema. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Nanatu ananabhahaghulya bhandu bhangu bha Izilaeli pandu pa kutama, ananabhajokakyaji, nahuli bhatama pandu pabhu bheni, ngabhing'ahakika kabhete. Bhandu bhahakau ngabhabhoneli kabhete, ngati mokwabheli pakutumbula hapa. <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />Kutumbu chikahi panakabhahawili bhatemula panani ja bhandu bhangu bha Izilaeli, bhelabhela ananumpekya chiheku palongi ja maadui bhaku bhokapi. Bhelabhela Bambo Chapanga mweni akupwaghi anaakuchengila wehapa nyumba. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Machobha ghaku paghikubha ghajomwiki, bhandu anabhakutagha wehapa mu matengeli gha akatati bhaku, nanatu ananuntenda jumu wa bhabhelakeka bhaku wamwete kubha nkolongwa pandu paku wehapa, nanatu ananujemakya ukolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Jonihoju nde joananjengila nyumba kwa ndandi jangu, nanatu ananyemakya chitehu cha ukolongwa waki mileli. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Nepani anangubha tati waki, najombi anaakubha mwana wangu. Anaahengiki mahakau, ananundapula ngati mundu moandapuli mwana waki wa chiboku. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Nambu nganambokeli upalu wangu kwaki, ngati monakubhohili kwaka Sauli, jonakumbohiki abhoka palongi jaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Nyumba jaku na ukolongwa waku anautamakya mileli palongi jangu. Nachombi chitehu chaku cha ukolongwa ananichitenda chijemakya mileli.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Bhela Nasani akumpwaghi Daudi malobhi ghanihagha ghokapi, na mabhonu ghanihagha ghokapi.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhu gha kuchengula ghaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 17:16-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Bhela nkolongwa Daudi akajingi mkati ja lihema na kutama palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kupwagha, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, bho, nepani nde nani na bhandu bha munyumba jangu nde kyani, hata unetiki pambani pamile? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Lijambu alale lakabhi lichoku palongi jaku wehapa wa Bambo Chapanga, nakanopi ja ghanihagha ubhalaghili bhandu bha munyumba jangu mambu makolongwa kwa machobha ghaghahika. Bho, ajeji le nde indela jaku ja kawaida ja kunjangati mundu, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga? <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Bho, nepani nukupwaghila chindu bholi nakanope? Maghambu ummanyi mtumika waku, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Kwa ndandi ja lilobhi laku, na mapalu ghaku wamwete, utendiki mambu aghagha makolongwa, na kundenda nepani mtumika waku naghamanyaje. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Chakaka, wehapa nde unkolongwa, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, wa Chapanga! Njeta jongi joabhi nkolongwa ngati wehapa, wala njeta Chapanga jongi nambu wehapa, ngati bhela motujowanili kwa makutu ghitu tabhete. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Kabhete nde bhandu bholi pani pundema bhabhaweza kulenganeswa na bhandu bhaku bha Izilaeli, ambabhu Chapanga wabhu akapiti kubhakombola nahuli bhakubha bhandu bhaki mwene? Wenga wa Chapanga ulitendili lihina wamwete, na kulitendela mambu makolongwa na gha kukangacha kwa ndandi ja inchi jaku palongi ja bhandu bhaku ambabhu kwa ndandi jaku wamwete akabhakombwili kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili, kwa kubhatopola bhandu bha inchi nayengi na ichapanga yabhu. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Ubhajemakakili bhandu bhaku bha Izilaeli kwa ndandi jaku wamwete, nahuli bhakubha bhandu bhaku mileli, nanau wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, ubhi wa Chapanga wabhu.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Bhela, wa Bambo Chapanga, ukatimiza lilobhi lela leukapwaghiki panani jaka mtumika waku, na panani ja bhandu bha munyumba jangu, ulitenda lijemakya mileli, kwa kutenda ngati moaukalaghile. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Nalombi lihina laku analilumbalika mileli, nabhombi bhandu anabhapwaghaje, ‘Bambo Chapanga wa manjolinjoli nde Chapanga joatawala panani ja Izilaeli.’ Na bhandu bha munyumba jangu nepani mtumikwa waku, anabhajemakya mileli palongi jaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Kwa kubha, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga wa manjolinjoli, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, uniyekulili nepani mtumika waku, ukapwaghaje, ‘Ananukuchengila nyumba,’ nde ndandi mweni kubha nde wichu muntima wangu kukulobha lulobhu lendenu.<verse eid="2SA 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />“Henu, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, wa Chapanga, wehapa nde wa Chapanga. Malobhi ghaku nde chakaka, nanau unaghili nuntumika waku lijambu aleli lamboni. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Bhela, sajenu nukulobha ubhapengalya bhandu bha munyumba jangu nepani mtumika waku, nahuli bhatamakya mileli palongi jaku, kwa kubha wehapa wa Bambo Chapanga, wa Chapanga, upwaghiki bhenibhela, na kwa mbengalelu yaku bhandu bha munyumba jangu anabhapengaliwa mileli.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuweza kwa manjolinjoli ghaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 18:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Paghakapetiki ghanihagha, Daudi akabhalapwi na kubhaweza Bhafilisti. Najombi akautoliki kwa makili muchi wa Metegi Ama kuhuma mu utawala wa Bhafilisti.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Bhela Daudi akabhalapwi Bhamoabu. Akabhapangiki bhandu bhaakabhatoliki kwa makili habha mu misitali, na kubhaghoneka pahi. Akalaghalaki bhala bhabhakabhi mu misitali jibheli bhakomakikaje, na bhala bha msitali wa katatu ngabhikomakeka. Bhela, Bhamoabu bhakabhi bhatumika bhaka Daudi, na bhakabhi bhundepa kode.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Bhelabhela Daudi akunhweziki Hadadezeli, mwana waka Lehobu, nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Soba. Daudi akamuweziki chikahi Hadadezeli paakabhi mwindela kujenda kukelabhuha pandu pa nkoka Eufulati, nahuli kubha kabhete pandu pa utawala waki. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi akabhatoliki kwa makili bhajendesha falasi elufu jimu na mia saba, na manjolinjoli bhabhajenda kwa magholu elufu ishilini. Bhela Daudi akahekiti mihipa ja kunyuma ja falasi yokapi yeikabhi ihuta magali, nambu akailekiki pela falasi mia jimu panga kuiheketa mihipa ja kunyuma.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Nabhombi Bhasilia bha kuhuma ku muchi wa Damasko pabhakapiti kunjangati nkolongwa Hadadezeli, nkolongwa wa ku Soba, Daudi akabhalapwili na kubhakoma manjolinjoli elufu ishilini na ibheli. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Bhela Daudi akabhekiki likambi la manjolinjoli ku muchi wa Bhasilia bha ku muchi wa Damasko. Bhela Bhasilia bhakabhi bhatumika bhaki na bhakabhi bhundepa kode. Bambo Chapanga akunjangati Daudi kuweza kila koakapiti kukomana ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Daudi akaitoliki ngau ya zahabu yeyakabhi ya manjolinjoli bhaka Hadadezeli, na kuileta ku muchi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Bhelabhela nkolongwa Daudi akatoliki madini ghamaheli namaa gha shaba kuhuma ku michi ja Beta na Belotai, jejakabhi michi jaka Hadadezeli.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Chikahi nkolongwa Tou, wa ku muchi wa Hamati, paakajowini kubha Daudi abhalapwi manjolinjoli bhokapi bhaka Hadadezeli, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />akuntumiki Yolamu, mwana waki, kwaka nkolongwa Daudi nahuli kundamukila na kumpongeza kwa ndandi ja kundapula na kumuweza Hadadezeli kungondo. Maghambu Hadadezeli akabhi akomana ngondo pamaheli na Tou. Yolamu akundetili Daudi nhupu ya yombu ya madini gha feza, yombu ya zahabu na yombu ya shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Nkolongwa Daudi akaibhekiki yombu yeniheyi yokapi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, ngati moakahengi kwa madini gha feza, na zahabu yeakabhi aitoliki kwa makili kuhuma kwa inchi yokapi yeakaiweziki kungondo. <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Yani kuhuma kwa bhandu bha ku Edomu, bhandu bha ku Moabu, bhandu bha ku Amoni, Bhafilisti, na Bhaamaleki, papamu na hindu yokapi yeakaitoliki kwa makili kuhuma kwaka Hadadezeli, mwana waka Lehobu, nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Soba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Bhela lihina laka Daudi lakajonjukiki kumanyikana, chikahi paakabhi akelabhuka kuhuma kubhakoma Bhaedomu elufu komi na nane, ku libondi la Mwinyu. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Daudi akabhekiki kambi ya manjolinjoli mu pandu pokapi pa Edomu. Nabhombi Bhaedomu bhokapi bha konihoku bhakabhi bhatumika bhaki. Bambo Chapanga akunjangati Daudi kuweza kila koakapiti kukomana ngondo.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Bhela, Daudi akatawili panani ja inchi jokapi ja Izilaeli, najombi akabhahengi bhandu bhaki bhokapi utemulu ghoupalika. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoabu mwana waka Seluya, akabhi nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli, na Yehoshafati mwana wa Ahiludi, akabhi mlemba wa kombukombu. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki mwana waka Ahitubu, na Ahimeleki mwana waka Abiasali, bhakabhi bhapenganyambiku, Selaya akabhi mlemba. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, akabhi chiongozi wa Bhakeleti na Bhapeleti, nabhombi bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Daudi bhakabhi bhapenganyambiku.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Lichobha limu, Daudi akalalukile, “Bho, kubhi le na mundu jokapi jola joahighalile pachilanda ja bhandu bha munyumba jaka Sauli, nahuli nuntendila ghamboni kwa ndandi jaka Yonasani?”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Bhela kukabhi na mtumika pachilanda ja bhandu bha munyumba jaka Sauli, joakalowakiki Siba. Bhela Siba akalowakiki kujenda kwaka Daudi. Najombi nkolongwa Daudi akumpwaghile, “Bho, wehapa le wa Siba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Najombi akayangike, “Ena, nepani nde nuntumika waku.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Nkolongwa akalalukile, “Bho, kubhi le na mundu joahighalili pachilanda ja bhandu bha munyumba jaka Sauli, nahuli nunhengila wamboni waka Chapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siba akayangike, “Akali abhi mwana waka Yonasani, nambu jombi nde chilema wa magholu ghokapi.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Nkolongwa akalalukile, “Bho, abhi kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Siba akayangike, “Abhi kunyumba jaka Makili, mwana waka Amieli, ku muchi wa Lo Debali hoku.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Bhela, nkolongwa Daudi akabhatumiki bhandu, najombi akaletakiki kuhuma kunyumba jaka Makili, mwana waka Amieli, ku Lo Debali hoku.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Bhela, Mefibosheti mwana waka Yonasani, nchokolu waka Sauli akapiti kwaka nkolongwa Daudi, na chikahi paakahikiki kwaka nkolongwa Daudi, akajinimi ukutama nahuli kuntopela. Daudi akundohiki, “Mefibosheti.” Najombi akayangike, “Naam! Nepani pambane nuntumika waku.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Daudi akumpwaghile, “Ngawijoghopa. Nepani ananukutendila ghamboni kwa ndandi jaka tati waku Yonasani. Pandu pokapi papakabhi paka hoko waku Sauli, ananukukelabhukyaje. Nanau machobha ghokapi anaukula chilebhi pameza jangu.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosheti akachikimi, na kupwagha, “Nepani nde ngati nakawa jejiwile, bho, maghambu kiki unhengila wamboni ghonihogho?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Bhela, nkolongwa Daudi akundohiki Siba mtumika waka Sauli, na kumpwaghila, “Numpekihi Mefibosheti, nchokolu waka bambo waku, mali ghokapi ghaghakabhi ghaka Sauli na bhandu bha munyumba jaki. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Wehapa, bhana bhaku na bhatumika bhaku mwandemila Mefibosheti na kundete mahunu nahuli nchokolu waka bambo waku akubha na chilebhi chikahi chokapi. Nambu Mefibosheti nchokolu waka bambo waku anaakula chilebhi pameza jangu.” Chikahi chenihechi Siba akabhi na bhana komi na nhwanu bha chikambaku, na bhatumika ishilini.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Bhela, Siba akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Nepani nuntumika waku, ananhenga ghokapi aghagha, ngati wa bambo wangu nkolongwa mounaghalaki kuhenga.” Bhela Mefibosheti akabhi akula chilebhi chaki pameza jaka Daudi, ngati jumu wa bhana bha kikolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefibosheti akabhi na mwana nchoku wa chikambaku joakalowakiki Mika. Bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaka Siba bhakabhi bhatumika bhaka Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Bhela, Mefibosheti joakabhi na chilema cha magholu ghaki ghokapi ghabheli, akatami ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, na kupata chilebhi chaki kuhuma pameza jaka nkolongwa chikahi chokapi.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Daudi abhaweza Bhaamoni na Bhasilia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 19:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Paghakapetiki ghanihagha, nkolongwa Nahashi wa Bhaamoni akapotile, najombi mwana waki joakalowakiki Hanuni, akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Nkolongwa Daudi akaholalile, “Ananuntendila ghamboni Hanuni, mwana waka Nahashi, ngati tati waki moakandendili nepani wamboni.” Bhela, Daudi akabhatumiki bhabholu nahuli kupeleka ulamukilu kwaka Hanuni kwa ndandi ja nyiwa jaka tati waki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Bhabholu bhaka Daudi pabhakahikiki ku inchi ja Bhaamoni, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />ihongozi bha Bhaamoni bhakumpwaghi Hanuni, bambo wabhu, “Bho, uholake Daudi antopi tati waku kwa kubhatuma bhandu kwaku nahuli kulangiha kubha umbiniki mtima? Bho, Daudi le ngacheabhatumiki bhandu abhabha kwaku nahuli kuuchunguza na kuupelaleza muchi nahuli bhauyonangaje?”<verse eid="2SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Bhela, Hanuni akabhakamwi bhandu bhaka Daudi, na kubhamogha kila mundu nusu ja indehu yaki, akaikachwili ingobhu yabhu pachilanda ja matamilu, na kubhaleka bhajendaje. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Chikahi Daudi paakapwaghakiki lijambu leniheli, akabhatumiki bhabholu nahuli kujenda kubhajopalela, maghambu bhakabhi bhahekatiwi utopelu wabhu namaa. Najombi nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Ntamaje ku muchi wa Yeliko, mbaka paimela indehu hinu, panihapa nde mwihikaje.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Bhela Bhaamoni pabhakamanyiki kubha bhuntendiki Daudi kuhakalila, bhakaajili manjolinjoli bha ku Silia bhabhajenda kwa magholu elufu ishilini, kuhuma ku Beti Lehobu na ku Soba. Bhelabhela akuntoliki nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Maaka, papamu na manjolinjoli elufu jimu, na manjolinjoli elufu komi na ibheli kuhuma ku muchi wa Tobu. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Daudi paakajowini lijambu leniheli, akuntumiki Yoabu papamu na manjolinjoli bhokapi bhana makili. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Bhaamoni bhakapitiki kunja na kulipanga kwa ngondo pundyangu wabhu ukolongwa wa muchi wa Laba, nabhombi Bhasilia kuhuma ku Soba, na Lehobu na bhandu kuhuma ku muchi wa Tobu na Maaka, bhakabhi kanjika jabhu pa uwanda.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Bhela Yoabu paakaweni kubha kulongi jaki na kunyuma jaki kubhi na manjolinjoli gha maadui, akabhahawi manjolinjoli bhakumu bhabhabhi na makili bha Izilaeli, na kubhapanga nahuli bhakomana na Bhasilia. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Bhandu bhala bhabhakahighalili akabhabhekiki pahi ja ulonguheku waka ndongu waki Abishai, na jombi akabhapangiki nahuli bhakomana na Bhaamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoabu akapwaghike, “Ngati Bhasilia anabhambetiki makili, wihika kunyangatila. Nambu ngati Bhaamoni anabhukupetiki makili, nepani ananhika kukujangatila. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Ukangamalaje, na tukomana kwa kukangamala, kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhitu, na kwa ndandi jaka Chapanga witu. Najombi Bambo Chapanga anaahenga lelibhi lamboni palongi jaki.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Bhela, Yoabu papamu na bhandu bhabhakabhi papamu naku bhakaheghali kulongi nahuli kukomana ngondo na Bhasilia, nabhombi Bhasilia bhakatilike. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Chikahi Bhaamoni pabhakaweni kubha Bhasilia bhatenda kutila, nabhombi bhakatiliki palongi jaka Abishai, na kujingi mkati ja muchi. Bhela, Yoabu akakotwiki kukomana na Bhaamoni, na kukelabhuka ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Nambu Bhasilia pabhakaweni kubha bhalepalili palongi ja Bhaizilaeli, bhakalibhongini kabhete. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadezeli akalaghalaki Bhasilia bhabhakabhi bhatama kwihi ja nkoka Eufulati bhaletakikaje, na kupelekwa ku muchi wa Helamu, koni bhakalonguhika na Shobaki, linjolinjoli nkolongwa waka Hadadezeli. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Daudi paakapwaghakiki mambu ghanihagha, akabhabhongini Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, na kulomboka nkoka Yoludani, na kujenda mbaka ku muchi wa Helamu. Nabhombi Bhasilia bhakalipangiki tayali kwa ndandi ja kukomana ngondo na Daudi, na bhakatumbwi kukomana naku. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Nambu Bhasilia bhakatiliki palongi ja Bhaizilaeli, najombi Daudi akabhakomiki Bhasilia mia saba bhabhakabhi bhajendesha magali gha kuhutakika, na manjolinjoli elufu alobaini bhabhakabhi bhajendesha falasi. Bhelabhela akundapwi Shobaki joakabhi linjolinjoli wabhu nkolongwa, na kupotela pala pala. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Bhela bhakolongwa bhokapi bhabhakabhi bhuntumaki Hadadezeli pabhakaweni kubha bhalepalili palongi ja Bhaizilaeli, bhakatendiki majonganu gha lukwali na bhandu bha Izilaeli, na kubha bhatumika bha Bhaizilaeli. Bhela Bhasilia bhakajowipi kubhajangati Bhaamoni kabhete.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Batisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Bhela mu utumbulilu wa chaka chahenu, chikahi bhakolongwa pabhajenda kungondo, Daudi akuntumiki Yoabu, na bhatumika bhaki, papamu na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, nahuli kujenda kubhayonanga Bhaamoni, na kuuyongalota muchi wa Lama kwa manjolinjoli. Nambu Daudi mweni akahighali mu Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Lichobha limu, chikahi cha pakamihi, Daudi akajumwiki pachitanda chaki, na kujenda jenda panani ja nhwaghala wa nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa. Paakabhi ajenda jenda kunhwaghala kola, akumbweni mbomba jumu akajogha machi cha kutali. Mbomba jonihoju akabhimnyahi namaa kwa sula. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Bhela Daudi akuntumiki mundu kujenda kulalukila malobhi kubhokana na mbomba jola. Mundu hoju akumpwaghi Daudi, “Mbomba jonihoju nde Batisheba mwali waka Eliabu, nhwanu waka Ulia, Mhiti.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Bhela, Daudi akatumiki bhabholu bhakundeta Batisheba kwaki. Bhela Batisheba akahikiki kwaka Daudi, najombi Daudi akaghoni naku kihyegha. Chikahi chenihechi mbomba jonihoju akabhi nde ahuma mu kuligholola kubhokana na kujomola mambu ghaki gha kumwehi. Bhela akabhujiki kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Mbomba jonihoju akapatiki chitumbu, najombi akumpelaki Daudi ubholu kupwagha, “Nepani mi na chitumbu.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Bhela, Daudi akapeliki ubholi kwaka Yoabu, akapwaghaje, “Umpwaghila Ulia, Mhiti, ahika kwangu nepani.” Najombi Yoabu akuntumiki Ulia kwaka Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Ulia paakahikiki kwaka Daudi, Daudi akundaluki malobhi kubhokana na Yoabu, ntundu manjolinjoli mobhajendalela, na malobhi gha ngondo mojijendalela. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Bhela Daudi akumpwaghi Ulia, “Ubhuja kunyumba jaku na ukapomulya kwa chikahi.” Bhela Ulia akabhokiki kuhuma panyumba ja kikolongwa, najombi nkolongwa Daudi akumpelaki Ulia nhupu. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Nambu Ulia ngacheakabhujiki kunyumba jaki, nambu akaghoni papamu na bhalonda bhokapi bhaka bambo waki pundyangu ukolongwa wa nyumba ja kikolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Chikahi Daudi paakapwaghakiki kubha Ulia ngacheakapiti kunyumba jaki, Daudi akundaluki Ulia, “Wehapa uhuma kumwanja, bho, maghambu kiki ngachewabhujiki kunyumba jako?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Ulia akamuyangiki Daudi, “Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, papamu na manjolinjoli bhokapi bha Izilaeli na manjolinjoli bha Yuda bhatama mu mahema kungondo. Najombi Yoabu bambo wangu na bhatumika bhaki bhokapi bhabhekiki likambi ku uwanda, bho, wichu le kwangu nepani kujenda kughone kunyumba jangu, kula na kunywa, na kughone kihyegha na nhwanu wango? Chakaka nukulapi wehapa unkolongwa, nepani ngenhwezi kuhenga chindu ngati chenihechi!”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Bhela, Daudi akumpwaghi Ulia, “Haya, utama pambani kwa lichobha limu nakanopi, na chilabhu ananukuleka ubhujaje.” Bhela Ulia akahighali mu muchi wa Yelusalemu kwa lichobha lenilela, na lichobha la kabheli laki. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi akunkokiki Ulia kula na kunywa kunyumba jaki ja kikolongwa, na kuntenda Ulia kulobhela. Hata bhela, ikilu jenijela, Ulia ngacheakabhujiki kujenda kughone kunyumba jaki, nambu akaghoni pa uleli pachilanda ja bhatumika bhaka bambo waki.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Bhela, pakwahiki lukela, Daudi akundembi Yoabu baluwa, na kumpeke Ulia nahuli ajipelaka kwaka Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Mkati ja baluwa heji akalembiki ana: “Umbeka Ulia mu msitali wa palongi, pandu ambapu ngondo nde ngolongwa nakanopi, na bhela undeka konihoku na kukelabhuka kunyuma nahuli alapulikaji na kupotela.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Bhela, Yoabu paakabhi auyongalota muchi akumbekiki Ulia pandu ambapu akamanyi kubha manjolinjoli bha maadui bhabhi na makili namaa. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Chikahi bhandu bha muchi ghonihoghu pabhakapitiki kujenda kukomana ngondo na Yoabu, bhandu bhakumu pachilanda ja manjolinjoli bhaka Daudi bhakakomakike, najombi Ulia, Mhiti, akapotile.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Bhela, Yoabu akumpelaki Daudi malobhi ghokapi kubhokana na ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Yoabu akuntumiki mbolu, akapwaghaje, “Anaujomwi kumpwaghi nkolongwa mambu ghokapi kubhokana na ngondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />nkolongwa aweza kubha na inyela, na kukulalukila, ‘Bho, maghambu kiki mkapiti pambipi na muchi pamukabhi nkomana ngondo? Bho, ngachemwamanyi kubha bhaweza kunhoma mipendi kwa kupetela mu lumatu ya muchi wabho? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Bho, ngachenkomboka kubha nde nane joakunkomiki Abimeleki, mwana waka Yelubesheti? Bho, si mbomba jumu mu muchi wa Tebesi ambaju akahomiki liganga la kuyaghila kwa kupete mulumatu, nalombi lakunkomiki Abimeleki? Henu, maghambu kiki mkapiti pambipi na lumatu lwa muchi?’ Bhela, wehapa wamuyanga ana, ‘Bhelabhela hata mtumika waku Ulia, Mhiti, apotile.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Bhela mbolu jola akabhokiki na kujenda kwaka Daudi, na paakahikiki akumpwaghi Daudi kila chindu ngati moakapwaghakiki na Yoabu apwaghaje. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Mbolu jola akumpwaghi Daudi, “Maadui bhitu bhakatupetiki makili, nabhombi bhakapitiki kunja ja muchi na kutulapula ku uwanda. Hata bhela, tepani tukabhakelawihi mbaka pambipi na ndyangu wa ukolongwa wa muchi. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Panihapa bhahoma mipendi bhakahomiki mipendi jabhu kwitu tepani bhatumika bhaku kwa kupete mulumatu lwa muchi wabhu. Bhatumika bhaku bhakumu bhakakomakike. Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, hata mtumika waku Ulia, Mhiti, najombi apotile.” <verse eid="2SA 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi akumpwaghi mbolu jola, “Ukumpwaghila Yoabu, ‘Lijambu aleli ngalakung'aha ndandi lipanga ngachelibhi na mihu, na ngondo jikoma mundu jokapi jola. Nambu ujonjukya kuulapu muchi na uyonanga muchi ghonihoghu.’ Ukumpwaghila Yoabu bhenibhela nahuli kunjeghe mtima.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Bhela Batisheba, nhwanu waka Ulia paakajowini kubha ndomi waki Ulia apotile, akundeli ndomi waki. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Chikahi cha maombulezu pachakapetiki, Daudi akalaghalaki Batisheba atolakikaje na kupelekwa kunyumba jaki. Batisheba akabhi nhwanu waka Daudi, najombi akumbelaki Daudi mwana wa chikambaku. Nambu Bambo Chapanga akahakali namaa kubhokana na lijambu leniheli leakahengiki Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Nasani andakali Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akuntumiki mlota Nasani kwaka Daudi. Paakahikiki kwaka Daudi, akumpwaghile, “Kukabhi na muchi ghumu ukabhi na bhandu bhabheli, jumu akabhi na hindu yamaheli na jongi akabhi kahochu. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Mwanahindu yamaheli jola akabhi na mambeleli ghamaheli na ng'ombi yamaheli, <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />nambu kahochu jola akabhi na kakenda ka limbeleli kachoku kambomba kaakabhi akahemile. Akalidimiki limbeleli heli, lakakolili kwaki papamu na bhana bhaki. Limbeleli heli lakabhi likula chilebhi chaka bambo waki na kunywelela chikombi chaki hata bhela limbeleli heli lighonila mu mabhoku ghaka bambo waki. Kwaki akabhi ngati mwali waki. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Lichobha limu mwanahindu yamaheli jola akahikiwi na ngeni, nambu mwanahindu yamaheli jola ngacheakapaliki kutola limu la limbeleli wala ng'ombi yaki mweni nahuli kunchinji ngeni, nambu akatoliki limbeleli lichoku limbomba lela lelakabhi laka kahochu jola na kunchinji ngeni waki jola.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Bhela Daudi paakajowini mambu ghanihagha akamuyomi namaa mundu mwanahindu yamaheli jola, na akumpwaghi Nasani, “Chakaka nukulapila kwaka Bambo Chapanga, mundu hoju joatendiki mambu ghanihagha impalika kupotela! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Impalika andepa kahochu hoju mwanalimbeleli, ipalika andepa mala pacheche nakanopi, kwa ndandi atendiki lijambu lihakau na ngacheakabhi na chiha.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Bhela Nasani akumpwaghi Daudi, “Wehapa nde wa mundu jonihoju!” “Henu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli apwagha anana: ‘Nakakupakiki mahuta ukubha unkolongwa wa Izilaeli, na kukukengalela kuhuma mu chiwoku chaka Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Nukupekihi nyumba jaka bambo waku na akabhahanu bhaka bambo waku, bhakubha bhaku wehapa. Nakakupekihi ukolongwa panani ja Izilaeli na Yuda. Ngati ghanihagha ghokapi ghakabhi machoku nakanopi, nakabya nukupekihi hata nakanopi. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Bho, maghambu kiki ulijojwihi lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga kwa kuhenga lijambu lelibhi lihakau palongi jaki? Ukunkomiki Ulia, Mhiti, kwa lipanga na kuntola nhwanu waki kubha nhwanu waku. Ubhatumili Bhaamoli bhunkoma Ulia kungondo. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Bhela lipanga ngalibhoki munyumba jaku ng'o kwa ndandi ukanyojwihi nepani, na kuntola nhwanu waka Ulia, Mhiti, kubha nhwanu waku.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Ujowanyaje, Bambo Chapanga apwagha, ‘Lingalyaje, ananeta mahakau kwa bhalongu bhaku wamweti. Ananabhatola akabhahanu bhaku koni wamwete ukabya ubhona, na kumpeke njaku, najombi anaaghonila nabhu kihyegha palanga. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Wehapa ukatendiki lijambu heli kwa kulihiya, nambu nepani anandenda lijambu leniheli palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, koni lyobha libhala.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Bhela Daudi akamyangiki Nasani, “Nuntendi Bambo Chapanga mahoku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Nasani akamyangike, “Bambo Chapanga akubhokili mahoku ghaku, nanau ngawipoteli. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Nambu kwa kubha kwa kutenda lijambu lendenu ubhapekihi maadui bhaka Chapanga mbekenyu ngolongwa ja kuntondola, mwana joanabhelakika kwaku chakaka anapotilaje.”<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Bhela Nasani akakelawiki kunyumba jaki.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Kupotela kwaka mwana waka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Bambo Chapanga akundapwi kwa chitamu mwana jola ambaju Batisheba nhwanu waka Ulia akumbelaki Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daudi akundobhiki Chapanga kwa ndandi jaka mwana apata kulama. Akakongiki kula chilebhi na akajingi mkati ja nyumba jaki akabya machobha ghokapi aghoni pasakafu ikilu jokapi. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Ihingozi bha munyumba jaki bhakunjendili na kujema pambipi naku nahuli kunjumuha kuhuma pasakafu pala, nambu jombi akakaniki, wala ngacheakakuliki chilebhi chokapi chela papamu nabhu. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Lichobha la saba mwana hoju akapotile. Bhatumika bhaka Daudi bhakajowipi kumpwaghi kubha mwana apotile, kwa ndandi bhakaholalili, “Chikahi mwana paakabhi akona mwomi, tukalongili naye, nambu ngacheakatujowanile. Henu, anatuweza bholi kumpwaghi kubha mwana apotile? Aweza kuhenga chindu cha kulipoteka!”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Daudi paakaweni bhatumika bhaki bhajojalanela bheni kwa bheni, najombi akamanyiki kubha mwana ajomwi kupotela. Akabhalalukile, “Bho, mwana apotile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Nabhombi bhakamyangike, “Ena, mwana apotile.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Bhela Daudi akajumwiki kuhuma pasakafu pala. Akajoghiki machi na kulipaka mahuta, na kuhwata ingobhu nahengi, bhela akapiti mkati ja nyumba jaka Chapanga, na kujojabhela. Paakajomwi kutenda bhenibhela akabhujiki kunyumba jaki, na paakapaliki chilebhi bhakumpekihi, najombi akakulike.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Bhela bhatumika bhaki bhakundalukile, “Bho, maghambu kiki utenda bhenibhela? Mwana paakabhi akali mwomi, wehapa ukakongiki kula chilebhi na kulela. Nambu sajenu mwana apotili, ujumwiki na kula chilebhi!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Daudi akabhayangike, “Chakaka mwana paakabhi akali mwomi, nakakongiki kula chilebhi na kulela. Nakatendiki bhenibhela kwa ndandi nakaholalile, ‘Bho, nde nani joamanya? Pangi Bambo Chapanga aweza kumone chiha nahuli kundeka mwana akubha mwomi.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Nambu sajenu kwa kubha apotile, maghambu kiki ngonga kula chilebhi? Bho, nepani le nhweza kunkelebhu kabheti akubha mwome? Lichobha limu nepani ananyenda konihoku koapiti jombi, nambu jombi ngacheaweza kukelebhuka kwangu nepani.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Bhela Daudi akunjeghi mtima Batisheba nhwanu waki, najombi akaghoni naku kihyegha. Batisheba akapatiki chitumbu na kulibopo mwana wa chikambaku, ambaju Daudi akundohiki Solomoni. Bambo Chapanga akumpaliki Solomoni, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />na kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga akumpaliki Solomoni, Chapanga akatumiki ubholu kwaka Daudi kupetela kwaka mlota Nasani, kubha mwana alohakika Yedidia kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi autola kwa makili muchi wa Laba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 20:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Chikahi chenihechi, Yoabu akaulapwi muchi wa Laba, muchi ukolongwa wa Bhaamoni, na kuutola kwa makili muchi wa kikolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Bhela Yoabu akatumiki bhabholu kwaka Daudi, kupwagha, “Nuulapwi muchi wa Laba, nanatu ndoliki chitumbulilu chabhu cha machi gha muchi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Henu ubhongana bhandu bhabhahighalili na ukauyongoluta muchi kwa manjolinjoli na kuutola kwa makili. Nanga bhela, ananutolaje nepani kwa makili, nawombi anaulohakika kwa lihina langu.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Bhela Daudi akabhongini manjolinjoli bhokapi na kujenda ku muchi wa Laba, akabhalapwi bhandu bha muchi ghonihoghu, na kuutola muchi hoghu kwa makili. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Bhela akatoliki kofia kuhuma pamutu jaka nkolongwa wabhu, jejakabhi na kutopa kwa kilu selasini na nhwanu, najombi jakabhi jibhekakiki hindu ya mbiya yamaheli, najombi jakabhekakiki panani ja mmutu waka Daudi. Bhelabhela akatoliki hindu yamaheli namaa kuhuma mu muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Akabhatoliki bhandu bhabhakabhi bhatama muchi ghonihoghu, na kubhabheka bhahenga lihengu la kutumila misumenu, sululu ya choma na mabhaghu gha choma, najombi akabhabhekiki mu lihengu la kufyatula matofali. Akatendiki bhenibhela kwa michi jokapi ja Bhaamoni. Pakujomulela Daudi na manjolinjoli ghaki bhokapi bhakakelawiki ku muchi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Aminoni na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Abisalomu akabhi na ndombu waki joakabhi mnyahi namaa, lihina laki akalowakiki Tamali. Aminoni, mwana jongi wa chikambaku waka Daudi, akumpaliki namaa Tamali. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Aminoni akang'ahakiki namaa kubhokana na Tamali mbaka akalwaliki, kwa ndandi Tamali akabhi kamwali bikila, na ikabhonakini kubha ngaiwezikani kwaka Aminoni kuhenga naku lijambu lokapi. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Nambu Aminoni akabhi na nkochi lihina laki akalowakiki Yonadabu, mwana waka Shimea, ndongu waka Daudi. Yonadabu akabhi mundu wa kuchenjela namaa. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Bhela Yonadabu akundaluki Aminoni, “Wehapa nde wa mwana waka nkolongwa, bho, maghambu kiki lichobha mbaka lichobha ubhonikana utenda kukombala? Na ngacheupala kumbwaghila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Aminoni akumpwaghile, “Numpala Tamali, ndombu waka ndongu wangu Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu akumpwaghile, “Ujenda ukaghonila pachitanda, na ulitenda kubha utenda kulwala. Tati waku paanahikaje kukubhona umpwaghilaje, ‘Undeka ndombu wangu, Tamali ahika anetila chokapi chela nahuli ngulaje. Chondi unjetakalya ahika andelakya chilebhi palongi jangu koni nakabya numbona, nahuli aneha chilebhi.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Bhela, Aminoni akaghoni pachitanda, na kulitenda kubha atenda kulwala. Nkolongwa paakahikiki kumbona, Aminoni akumpwaghile, “Undeka ndombu wangu, Tamali ahika anenganakya mabumunda machokopi koni nakabya nundingalila, nahuli anehaje.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Bhela, Daudi akapeliki ubholu kwaka Tamali ku nyumba ja kikolongwa hoku, akapwaghaje: “Ujenda mu nyumba jaka ndongu waku Aminoni, ukandenganakya chilebhi.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Tamali akapiti kunyumba jaka Aminoni joakabhi ndongu waki, na kunhimani Aminoni aghoni pachitanda. Tamali akatoliki uhembi ghoukajeghaliki amila akauhunyiki, na kulenganake mabumunda na kughajocha, koni Aminoni akundingalyaje. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Tamali akabhohiki mabumunda mu chikalangilu nahuli ampekya Aminoni, nambu Aminoni akakaniki kula. Aminoni akabhapwaghili bhahemba bhaki, “Mumpiha kunja kila mundu joabhi pambane.” Bhela kila mundu akabhokike. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Bhela, Aminoni akumpwaghi Tamali, “Unetila mabumunda ghanihagha mkati ja chumba changu nahuli uneha mabumunda ghanihagha.” Bhela Tamali akatoliki mabumunda ghaakalenganaki ghala, na kumpelake Aminoni joakabhi mbeli waki mkati ja chumba chaki. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Nambu paakabhi ampelakela mabumunda ghanihagha, Aminoni akunkamwi kwa makili, na kumpwaghila, “Uhika ughonila na nepani, ndombu wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamali akumpwaghile, “Ngabhela mbeli wangu! Ngawinyomalakela. Ndandi lijambu la ntundu ghonihoghu ngachelipalika kutendakeka mu Izilaeli! Ngawihenga lijambu leniheli la king'ang'a. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Kwa upambala wangu, anakubya bhole? Bho, anambelaka kwaku ihoni yeniheye? Bhelabhela kwa upambala waku, anakubya bhole? Anaukubha ngati jumu wa bhang'ang'a bhahakau mu Izilaeli. Chondi ulongila na nkolongwa, maghambu ngaakuhibhalaki kundoghola.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Nambu Aminoni ngachepaliki kunjowanela, na kwa ndandi akabhi na makili kumpeta Tamali, akunjomalakili na kughone naku chihyegha.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Bhela, Aminoni akunhakalili Tamali, kwa mahakalilu makolongwa namaa. Chakaka Aminoni akunhakalili kupeta moakabhi ampalike. Aminoni akumpwaghi Tamali, “Ujumuka, na upita kunja!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamali akumpwaghile, “Ngabhela! Kundopola anakubya kuhakahu nakanopi kupeta ghala ghaunhengile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Nambu Aminoni akakaniki kunjowanela. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Akundohiki mtumika waki joantumakyaje, na kumpwaghila, “Umboha mbomba ajoju palongi jangu, na ujighala ndyangu kwa kabali!” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Mtumika waka Aminoni jola akumpihiki kunja Tamali, na kujighi ndyangu kwa kabali. Tamali akabhi awati ingobhu jilachu jejilenganakiki wichu, kwa ndandi jikabhi nde ntundu wa ingobhu jejiwatakika na akakamwali bha kikolongwa bhabhakabhi mabikila. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Bhela, Tamali akalipakiki ilihu kumutu jaki, na kujikachu ingobhu jaki jilachu jeakabhi awati jela. Akabhekiki mabhoku ghaki kumutu, na kubhoka koni akabya alela kwa sauti. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Abisalomu paakumbweni Tamali, ndombu waki akundalukile, “Bho, Aminoni mbeli waku le, ahimangini na wehapa chihyegha? Henu utumbalaje, ndombu wangu, jombi nde ndongu waku. Ngawalibheka lijambu heli muntima jaku.” Najombi Tamali akatami kunyumba jaka Abisalomu, mbeli waki, koni akabya mbomba joumbina mtima.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Bhela nkolongwa Daudi paakajowini mambu ghanihagha ghokapi, akayomiki namaa. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abisalomu ngacheakalongi lilobhi lokapi lela na Aminoni, likubhi linyahi au lihakahu, kwa kubha akunhakali namaa Aminoni, maghambu akabhi ampohiki lihamu Tamali, ndombu waki.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu alepa kisasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Payakapetiki hyaka ibheli, chikahi bhaheketa mangoma gha mambeleli ghaka Abisalomu pabhakabhi ku Baali Hasoli hoku pambipi na malindakilu ghaka Efulaimu, Abisolomu akabhakokiki bhana bha chikambaku bhokapi bhaka nkolongwa nahuli bhajenda konihoku. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abisalomu akunjendi nkolongwa Daudi, na kumpwaghila, “Lingalyaje, nepani nuntumika waku mili na bhaheketa mangoma bha mambeleli bhabhahikike. Chondi nukulobha, unkolongwa papamu na bhatumika bhaku, tambokanyaje papamu na nepani, nuntumika waku.”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Nkolongwa akamuyangike, “Ngabhela, mwanango, ngatwijenda tabhokapi, nahuli ngatwikubha chibwahila kwaku.” Hata ngati Abisalomu akajendali kumpembalake nakanopi, nkolongwa akakaniki kujenda, nambu nkolongwa akumpengali Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Bhela, Abisalomu akapwaghike, “Ngati ngauhiki, chondi unjetakalya ndongu wangu Aminoni ajenda papamu na tepani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Nkolongwa akundalukili, “Bho, maghambu kiki ajenda papamu na wehapa?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Nambu Abisalomu akajendalili kundobha Daudi, na pakujomukela nkolongwa akunjetakili Aminoni papamu na bhana bhaki bhangi bhajenda ku uwangalalu ghanihoghu. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abisalomu akabhalaghalaki bhatumika bhaki: “Njowanyaje! Chikahi Aminoni paikubha akunywiki divai na kulobhela nakanopi nanatu ananumpwaghi mwehapa, ‘Mundapula Aminoni,’ bhela munkomaje. Ngamwijoghopa. Bho, nga nepani le nenundaghalaki mwehapa kuhenga bhenibhela? Mkubha na makili na mkangamalaje.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Bhela, bhatumika bhaka Abisalomu bhakunhengili Aminoni ngati Abisalomu moakabhi abhalaghalakile. Panihapa bhana bhokapi bhaka nkolongwa bhakabhokiki, na kutila kwa kutumi nyumbu yabhu.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Chikahi pabhakabhi mwindela, ubholu wakunhiki Daudi, kupwagha: “Abisalomu akomakiki na bhana bhokapi bhaka nkolongwa, njeta hata jumu wabhu joahighalile.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Nkolongwa Daudi akajumwiki, na kukachu ingobhu jaki, na kughone pahi paluhombi. Nabhombi bhatumika bhaki bhokapi bhakajemiki punkeghi jaki na ingobhu yabhu yakabya ikachuliwi. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Nambu Yonadabu, mwana waka Shimea, ndongu waka Daudi, akapwaghike, “Bambo wangu ngawiholale kubha bhana bhaku bhokapi bhatehi kukomakeka, nambu nde Aminoni kanjika jaki pela nde joapotile. Lendenu libhi liholalelu la mtima waka Abisalomu kutumbu lichobha lela Aminoni paakunhengi lijambu lihakau Tamali, ndombu waki. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Bhela, wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, ngawing'ahakika na ubholu kubha bhakomakiki bhana bhaku bhokapi. Aminoni kanjika jaki pela nde joakomakike.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Chikahi chenihechi, Abisalomu akabhi atilike.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Bhela mlonda akalingalakili, najombi akabhaweni bhandu bhamaheli mwindela upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha bhakahelala kuhuma upambala wa kunyuma ja katombi. Mlonda akapiti kumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Mona bhandu bhakahumila upambala wa ku Holonaimu, upambala wa kunyuma ja katombi hoku.”<verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu akumpwaghi Daudi, “Lingalyaje, bhana bhaku unkolongwa bhabhi pambane, kubhi ngati nepani mtumika waku monakakupwaghile.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Paakajomwili kupwagha, bhana bhaka nkolongwa bhakajingi mkati ja nyumba, na kutumbu kulela kwa sauti. Bhelabhela najombi nkolongwa, papamu na bhatumika bhaki bhokapi, bhakaleliki kwa mabhinilu namaa.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Nambu Abisalomu akatiliki na kujenda kwaka Talimai, mwana waka Amihudi, nkolongwa wa ku Geshuli. Nambu nkolongwa Daudi akundeli mwana waki Aminoni kwa machobha ghamaheli namaa. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Bhela Abisalomu akatiliki, na kujenda ku Geshuli, na akatami konihoku kwa hyaka itatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Nkolongwa Daudi akatokulili kunjendela Abisalomu, maghambu nkolongwa akabhi alihelihi mtima kubhokana na kupotela kwaka Aminoni.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu apanga kunkelebhu Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoabu mwana waka Seluya, akamanyiki kubha mtima waka nkolongwa Daudi ukabhi na chilolu cha kumbona Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Bhela Yoabu akatumiki bhandu kujenda ku Tekoa na kundeta mbomba joabhi na mbulau kuhuma konihoku. Akumpwaghi mbomba hoju, “Ulitenda ubhi mu chikahi cha kulela malelu. Uwata ingobhu ya maombulezu, na wehapa ngawalipaka mahuta ghokapi ghala gha kukunyambiha, ulitenda ngati mbomba ambaju abhi mu mabhinilu gha mtima kwa machobha ghamaheli kwa ndandi ja kuhwelewa. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Bhela, ujenda kwaka nkolongwa ukumpwaghila malobhi ghangane.” Najombi Yoabu akumpekihi ubholu mbomba jola.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Mbomba wa kuhuma ku Tekoa hoju akapiti kwaka nkolongwa, akachikimi na kujinama ukupama, nahuli kumpeke utopelu nkolongwa, akapwaghaje, “Wenga unkolongwa, unyangatyaje!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Nkolongwa akundalukile, “Ubhi na mang'ahiku bhole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Mbomba jola akayangike, “Nepani nde mbomba nenhweliwi na ndomi wangu. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Nepani mtumika waku nakabhi na bhana bhabheli. Lichobha limu bhakakomini ngondo bheni kwa bheni kungonda hoku wala konihoku ngachekukabhi mundu hata jumu wa kukenga ngondo jeniheji, na jumu akundapwi njaki na kunkoma. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Henu bhalongu bhangu bhokapi bhaniyomela nepani, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Utupekya mundu jola joankomiki ndongu waki, nahuli tunkomaje kwa ndandi ja womi waka ndongu waki joankomiki, panihapa na tepani anatubya tunhekatili kutali na mpwelelu waki.’ Anabhatendiki bhenibhela anabhakubha bhahimihi lihobhalelu langu lelihighalile, ndomi wangu ngayikubhi na lihina wala mwana pani pundema.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Nkolongwa akumpwaghi mbomba hoju, “Bhuja kunyumba jaku, nanatu anamoha lilaghalakilu kwa ndandi jaku.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Nambu mbomba wa kuhuma ku Tokea jola akupwaghile, “Bambo wangu nkolongwa, mahakau ghokapi ghabyaje kwangu na bhalongu bhangu na bhandu bha munyumba jaka tati wangu, najombi nkolongwa na chitehu chaku cha ukolongwa ngachikubha na mahakau.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Nkolongwa akayangike, “Anakubhi mundu jokapi anaakujowihi kwa chokapi, undetaje kwangu, najombi ngaakung'ahi kabhete.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Mbomba jola akapwaghike, “Chondi, nkolongwa, unobhila kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nahuli kuhibhalaki mlepa kisasi cha kukoma ngayijendale kuyonanga, ngabhihika kunkoma mwana wangu joahighalile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Chakaka ngati moatami Bambo Chapanga, njeta lijunju hata limu la pamutu jaka mwana waku leanalihabhuka pahi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Bhela mbomba jola akapwaghike, “Nukulobha, nepani mtumika waku, unyetakya kupwagha lilobhi kwaku wehapa, wa bambu wangu nkolongwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Nkolongwa akayangite, “Upwaghaje.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Mbomba hoju akapwaghike, “Henu maghambu kiki wehapa uholale lijambu ngati lendenu kwa bhandu bhaka Chapanga? Kubhokana na utemulu wako kwa lijambu lendenu, unkolongwa nde ngati ulitemwi wamwete kubha na mahakau, maghambu ngacheunjetakili mwana waku akelabhuka kunyumba kuhuma koakabhi atilile. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Tepani tabhokapi anatupotilaje. Tepani nde ngati machi ghaghajitiki pahi ambaghu ngacheghaweza kujolakeka. Hata Chapanga ngacheatenda ulenganganu kwaka mundu jumu na mundu jongi, nambu jombi alonda indela nahuli bhabhakanakiki, na kutila bhapata kukelabhuka kwaki. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Nepani nhikiki kulonge na wehapa, wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, maghambu bhandu bhatehi kunyoghoha. Henu nepani nuntumika waku, nakaholalili kubha, ‘Mbanga nongeli na nkolongwa, pangi aweza kunyangatila kwa ghala ghanundobha nepani mtumika waki. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Pangi nkolongwa ananyetakalya kungengalela nepani nuntumika waki kuhuma mu mabhoku ghaka mundu joalenga kunyonanga nepani papamu na mwana wangu, kuhuma mu upwelelu ghoatupekihi Chapanga.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Bhela mtumika waku apwagha, ‘Lilobhi laka bambo wangu nkolongwa analimbekya lukwali muntima, maghambo bambo wangu nkolongwa nde ngati mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga mu kumanya lamboni na lihakau. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na akubha papamu na wehapa!’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Panihapa nkolongwa akumpwaghi mbomba hoju, “Mbala kukulaluki lilalukilu limu, nambu ngawinhiya lijambu lokapi lela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Mbomba hoju akapwaghike, “Haya, bambo wangu nkolongwa, upwaghaje.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Nkolongwa akundalukile, “Bho, Yoabu le ahusika mu lijambu lendeno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Mbomba hoju akayangike, “Chakaka nukulapila, bambo wangu nkolongwa, njeta mundu jokapi jola joaweza kujepa kumalelelu au kumangeja kubhokana na chokapi cheapwagha bambo wangu nkolongwa. Ena, mtumika waku Yoabu nde joamoliki kuhenga anana, najombi nde joamoliki malobhi aghagha ghokapi ghanukupwaghi nepani nuntumika waku. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Mtumika waku Yoabu ahengiki bhenibhela nahuli kung'anambula ntundu wa lijambu aleli molibhelile. Bambo wangu nkolongwa abhi na mbulau ngati ja bhatumika bha kunani kwaka Chapanga, hata uweza kumanya mambu ghokapi ghaghabhi pani pundema.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Bhela nkolongwa akumpwaghi Yoabu, “Wichu namaa, ananilitenda lijambu lenu. Ujenda, ukunkelabhuha nkombu Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu akachikimi na kujinama ukutama mbaka paluhombi nahuli kumpeke nkolongwa utopelu, akapwaghaje, Lalenu nepani mtumika waku manyi kubha mbatiki chihomu palongi jaku, kwa kulijetakela lilobhu langu. <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Bhela, Yoabu akabhokiki, na kujenda ku muchi wa Geshuli, na kundeta Abisalomu ku muchi ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Nambu nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Abisalomu ajenda akatama kunyumba jaki, nepani ngachembala kuhimangana naku.” Bhela Abisalomu akabhi atama kunyumba jaki, na ngacheakahimangini na nkolongwa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu ajongana na nkolongwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Mu Izilaeli jokapi, nga mundu joakabhi na mnyahi ngati Abisalomu. Kutumbu lwaju lwaki mbaka palutoutou lwaki, Abisalomu ngacheakabhi na lijambu lokapi lela lihakau. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Chikahi chokapi paakabhi amogha majunju gha kumutu jaki, na kila chaka akabhi amogha majunju ghaki ndandi ghakatopiki namaa, nyweli heyi yakabhi na kutopa kwa kilu ibheli kulengana na ipemu ya kikolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abisalomu akabheliki bhana bhatatu bha chikambaku papamu na mwali jumu, lihina laki akalowakiki Tamali. Tamali akabhi mbomba mnyahi namaa kwa sula.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Bhela, Abisalomu akatami mu muchi wa Yelusalemu kwa chikahi cha hyaka ibheli, panga kumbona nkolongwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Bhela, Abisalomu akuntumi ubholu Yoabu, nahuli ajenda kwaka nkolongwa kwa ndandi jaki, nambu Yoabu akakaniki kuhika. Abisolamu akatumiki ubholu kwa mala ja kabheli, nambu Yoabu akakaniki kuhika. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Bhela, Abisalomu akabhapwaghi bhatumika bhaki, “Ndingaje, Yoabu abhi na ngonda wa shayili pambipi na ngonda wango. Njenda mkaujocha moto.” Bhela bhatumika bhaka Abisalomu bhakapiti kuujocha moto ngonda waka Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Bhela, Yoabu akapiti kunyumba jaka Abisalomu, na kundalukila, “Bho, maghambu kiki bhatumika bhaku bhachunjiki moto ngonda wangu?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abisalomu akamuyangike, “Lingalyaje, nakakupelakili ubholu, uhika kongone nahuli nukutuma kwaka nkolongwa, ukundalukyaje: ‘Bho, maghambu kiki nakabhokiki ku Geshuli? Ikabhi mbanga kwangu nakabya nhighali konihoku.’ Henu unyangatyaje nahuli mbata kumbona nkolongwa. Ngati anami na lihakau la lijambu lokapi lela bhela, angomaje!”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Bhela, Yoabu akapiti na kumpwaghi nkolongwa malobhi ghanihagha ghokapi, najombi nkolongwa akundohiki Abisalomu, najombi akajingili kunyumba jaka nkolongwa, akachikimi na kujinama ukutama mbaka pahi palongi jaka nkolongwa. Najombi nkolongwa akunjobhati Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu apanga uhakau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Paghakapetiki mambu ghanihagha, Abisalomu akapatiki magali gha ngondo gha kuhutakika na falasi na bhandu hamsini bha kundongule palongi. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abisalomu akayobhali kujumuka lukela pachibhombu na kujenda kujema punkeghi ja indela jejijenda ku ndyangu ukolongwa wa muchi. Mundu jokapi joakabhi na matakilu ambaju akapaliki kughapeleka kwaka nkolongwa nahuli kupata utemulu waki, Abisalomu akabhi andoha mundu hoju punkeghi na kundalukila, “Wehapa uhuma ku muchi bhole?” Ngati mundu hoju anaapwaghiki ahumiki ku muchi ghumu waki wa likabila la Izilaeli, <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Bhela Abisalomu akabi ampwaghila, “Lingalyaje, matakilu ghaku nde gha chakaka na manyahi, nambu njeta mundu joahaghuliwi na nkolongwa nahuli kukujowanela.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Bhelabhela Abisalomu akajonjuki kupwagha, “Ngati nepani nakabya nhaghuliki kubha mtemula mu inchi jenjenu! Kila mundu joabhi na matakilu na mang'ahiku akabya ahikiki kwangu nanatu nakabya numpeki chela cheapalika kupata.” <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Nyonjeka ja ghanihagha mundu jokapi paakunheghalili nahuli kunchikamila na kunjojabhe palongi jaki, Abisalomu akahatambwili chibhoku chaki, na kunkamula na kumbusu. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Abisalomu akajendalili na luhomu londoni palongi ja Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhabhakunjendi nkolongwa kundobha abhapekya chela chebhapalika kupata, bhela Abisalomu akajitendiki mitima ja bhandu bha Izilaeli kubha na ulongwana kwaki.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Payakapetiki hyaka ncheche, Abisalomu akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Chondi nukulobha unyetakalya nyenda ku Hebuloni, nahuli nakabhoha nazili jenakumbeki Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Chikahi mtumika waku paakabhi ku Geshuli hoku mu inchi ja Silia, nakabhekiki nazili nakapwaghaje, ‘Ngati Bambo Chapanga anaangelawihi ku Yelusalemu lukwali, bhela nepani ananunjojabya jombi ku Hebuloni hoku.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Nkolongwa akumpwaghile, “Ujenda kwa lukwale.” Bhela Abisalomu akabhokiki na kujenda ku Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Nambu Abisolamu akatumiki bhabholu kwa kulihiya mu makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli, kupwagha, “Chikahi pamwijowana sauti ja lipenenga, bhela mpwaghaje, ‘Abisalomu nde nkolongwa ku Hebuloni hoku!’ ” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Bhandu mia ibheli kuhuma ku Yelusalemu bhakabhi bhunjengale Abisalomu. Bhakabhi bhakokakiki ngati bhagheni nabhombi bhakapiti kwa nia jinyahi, panga kumanya lijambu lokapi lela. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Chikahi Abisalomu paakabhi abhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka, akatumiki bholu ku Gilo, nahuli kundoha Ahitofeli, Mgiloni, joakabhi mundu wa pambipi waka nkolongwa Daudi. Bhela mpangu uhakau waka Abisalomu ukajendali kupata makili, na bhandu bhabhakabhi bhalongana na Abisalomu bhakajendali kujonjukeka.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi atila kuhuma mu muchi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Mbolu jumu akunjendi Daudi, na kumpwaghila “Mitima ja bhandu bha Izilaeli jilangi ulongwana kwaka Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Bhela, Daudi akabhapwaghi bhatumika bhaki bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu na jombi ku Yelusalemu hoku, “Muhikaje! Itupalika tutilaje, nanga bhela, njeta hata jumu witu joanaweza kunjepa Abisalomu. Bhela, itupalika tubhoka manyata, nanga bhela, anahika imbelu na kutupata, anaatuyonangaji na kubhakoma bhandu bha muchi kwa mapanga.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Nambu bhatumika bhaka nkolongwa bhakayangike, “Tepani bhatumika bhaku tubhi tayali kuhenga lijambu lokapi lela lewihaghula wehapa wa bambo witu nkolongwa.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Bhela nkolongwa akabhokiki, nabhombi bhandu bha munyumba jaki bhakunjengalile, nambu akabhalekiki bhatumika bhaki bha chimbomba komi nahuli bhajighoha nyumba ja kikolongwa.<verse eid="2SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Bhela nkolongwa akabhokiki, papamu na bhandu bhaki bhokapi. Nambu akapomulili pachokopi pabhakahikiki ku Beti Melihaki, yani ujomukelu wa muchi. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Bhatumika bhaki bhokapi bhakajendiki, bhakampetiki bhakabya bhalongini na Bhakelesi na Bhapelesi bhokapi, kabheti Bhagiti bhokapi mia sita bhaakalongini nabhu kuhuma ku Gasi, bhakalongulili palongi jaka nkolongwa, <verse eid="2SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />nkolongwa akumpwaghili Itai, Mgiti, “Kwa ndandi kiki ulonganaje na tepane? Kelukaje ukatamaje papamu na nkolongwa Abisalomu. Wehapa nde wangeni, wanhika kuhuma kuinchi jako. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Wehapa uhikiti kongoni kwichukwichu pela. Bho, nepani nikutendaje ulyungalyungaje papamu natepane, chikahi ngachenimanyi konyenda? Kelukaje, nawehapa ukabhatolaje bhalongu bhaku. Wamboni na ulongwana na ukubha papamu na wehapa.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Nambu Itai akamuyangiti nkolongwa, “Chakaka ngati Bambo Chapanga moatamila na ngati bambu wangu nkolongwa moatamila, pokapi bambu wangu nkolongwa panakubha, ikubhi nde kutama au kupotela, panihapa nde mtumika waku panakubha.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Bhela Daudi akumyangiki Itai, “Jendaje henu, ujendalya.” Bhela Itai, Mgiti, akajendalili papamu na bhandu bhaki bhokapi, kabheti na bhalongu bhaki bhokapi bhabhakabhili papamu naku. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Bhandu bhokapi bha kunja ja muchi bhakaleliki kwa sauti chikahi bhandu bhokapi pabhakabhili bhapeta. Nkolongwa najombi akalombwiki likemba laku Kidiloni, nabhombi bhandu bhokapi bhakapiti ku chingwenji.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Najombi Sadoki akabhi, papamu na Bhalawi bhokapi bhabhakabhili papamu naku bhakabhili bhatotwili Lisanduku la Lilaghilu laka Chapanga. Bhakalitoliki pahi lisanduku laka Chapanga, najombi Mpenganyambiku Abiasali akabhohiki nyambiku ja kujochakeka pamoto mbaka bhandu bhokapi pabhakabhili bhabhokanili pambwani. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Bhela nkolongwa akumpwaghi Sadoki, “Ulikelabhuha Lisanduku laka Chapanga ku muchi. Ngati anambatiki chihomu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, anaangelabhukaje, nanatu ananilibhona kabhete Lisanduku leniheli, papamu na Lihema laki. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Nambu ngati Bambo Chapanga anapwaghiki, ‘Nepani ngachenyambakiki na wehapa,’ bhela nepani mi tayali jombi atendaje chokapi cheabhona jombi kubha chinyahi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Bhela nkolongwa Daudi akumpwaghi kabhete Sadoki, “Lingalyaje, bho wehapa le nga wa mlola? Ubhuja ku muchi kwa lukwali wehapa papamu na mwana waku Ahimaasi, na Yonasani mwana waka Abiasali. Wehapa na Abiasali mubhatola na bhana bhinu bhabheli. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Nambu nepani anangubha nendalela pandu papabhi na ilomboku koni kuchingwenje, mbaka panipata malobhi kuhuma kwinu mwehapa.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Bhela Sadoki na Abiasali bhakalikelawihi Lisandu la Lulaghilu laka Chapanga ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, na bheni bhakahighali konihoku.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Nambu Daudi akajendalile, akakweliki chitombi cha Mizeituni koni akalelaje, koni akabya ayekalili mmutu waki, na panga magubasi mumagholu ghaki. Hata bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu naku nabhombi bhakaliyekalili mimutu jabhu, na bhakabhi bhakwela chitombi koni bhakalelaje. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Chikahi chenihechi, Daudi akapwaghakiki kubha hata Ahitofeli akabhi nde jumu wa bhabhumpengiki na kulombana Abisalomu. Nambu Daudi akalobhiki apwaghaje, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, nukulobha, utenda mpangu waka Ahitofeli kubha chindu cha king'ang'a!”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Bhela, chikahi Daudi paakahikiki kunani ja chitombi, pandu pa kunjojobhe Chapanga, mundu jumu lihina laki Hushai kuhuma ku Aliki akahikiki nahuli kunjpalela, ingobhu yaki yakabhi ikachulike, na mmutu waki ukabhi na luhombi. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daudi akumpwaghile, “Anaupiti papamu na nepani, anaukubha chibwahila kwangu nepani. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Nambu ngati anaubhujiki ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, na kumpwaghi Abisalomu, ‘Anangubha nuntumika waku, wenga unkolongwa, ngati monakabheli nuntumika waka tati waku, pakutumbula hapa,’ bhela winyangatyaje nahuli mpangu waka Ahitofeli ngawihengakeka. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Bhapenganyambiku Sadoki na Abiasali anabhakubha papamu na wehapa ku muchi! Bhela, chokapi chewijowana kuhuma munyumba jaka nkolongwa, ubhapwaghila bhapenganyambiku Sadoki na Abiasali. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Lingalyaje, bhana bhabhu bhabheli bha chikambaku, Ahimaasi mwana waka Sadoki, na Yonasani mwana waka Abiasali, bhabhi papamu nabhu konohoku. Na chokapi chemwijowanaje mwinetila malobhi ghanihagha kwa kupete bhombi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Bhela, Hushai nkochi waka nkolongwa Daudi, akahikiki mu Yelusalemu chikahi Abisalomu paakabhi ajingi mu muchi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Siba na nkolongwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Bhela Daudi paakabhi apetiki pachokopi kuhuma panani ja chitombi, Siba mtumika waka Mefibpsheti akunjopali Daudi konihoku koni akabya na maponda ghaki ghabheli, ghaghakabhi aghatandiki koni ghatotwi mabumunda mia ibheli, ishada mia jimu ya zabibu jijomu, mapambiku mia jimu gha palumu, na mfuku wa chingumba ghoukabhi na divai. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Nkolongwa akundaluki Siba, “Bho, maghambu kiki uletiki hinde ayeye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Siba akamuyangike, “Maponda nde kwa ndandi ja kukwela bhandu bha munyumba jaka nkolongwa, mabumunda na mapambiku gha palumu nde kwa ndandi ja akakombu bhokapi, na divai nde kwa ndandi ja bhala bhabhitonda muchingwenje.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Bhela nkolongwa akundalukile, “Mwana waka bambo waku abhi kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Siba akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Jombi ahighali ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, maghambu aholake kubha lalenu bhandu bha Izilaeli anabhunkelabhukya ukolongwa waka hokolu waki Sauli.”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Nkolongwa akumpwaghi Siba, “Mali ghokapi ghaghakabhi ghaka Mefibosheti sajenu nde mali ghaku wehapa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Siba akumpwaghile, “Njengula, bambo wangu nkolongwa, nanatu nyopa mbata chihomu palongi jaku chikahi chokapi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei ampeke masolu nkolongwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Chikahi nkolongwa Daudi paakaheghali kuhika ku muchi wa Bahulimu, akapitalili mundu jumu kuhuma mu lukolu lololu lwaka Sauli, lihina laki akalowakiki Shimei, mwana waka Gela, akatumbwi kumpeke masolu Daudi paakabhi abhoka. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Akunhomi nkolongwa Daudi na bhatumika bhokapi bhaka nkolongwa Daudi. Bhandu bhangi bhokapi na bhana makili bhakabhi bhunhyongalwiti Daudi upambala wa kumalelelu na upambala wa kumangeja. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei akumpekii masolu Daudi akapwaghaje, “Ubhoka pambane, ubhoka pambane, wehapa wa mundu wa kukoma, mundu wangakubha na nyonjeka! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Baambo Chapanga akulepiki kubhokana na kihengu chaku cha kubhakoma bhandu bha munyumba jaka Sauli, ambaju sajenu wehapa utoliki ukolongwa kuhuma pandu paki. Henu, Bambo Chapanga ampeki ukolongwa mwana waku Abisalomu. Lingalya, henu mayonangeku ghakupatiki maghambu wehapa nde wa mkoma bhandu!”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Bhela Abishai mwana waka Seluya, akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Bho, maghambu kiki nakawa ajeji jejiwili jukupeke masolu wehapa wa bambo wangu nkolongwa? Unyetakalyaje nambuka nunjengalya, nahuli nakunhekata mmutu waki.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Nambu nkolongwa akumpwaghile, “Bho, kubhi kike pachilanda jangu nepani na mwehapa mabhana bhaka Seluya? Anakubhi Bambo Chapanga ampwaghi, ‘Umpekya masolu Daudi,’ bho, nde nane joaweza kulalukila, ‘Bho, maghambu kiki uhenga bhenibhela?’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Bhela nkolongwa Daudi akumpwaghi Abishai, na bhatumika bhaki bhokapi, “Anakubhi mwana wangu namweti aghalonda matamu ghangu, bho, nga nakanopi lelu kwa mundu wa likabila laka Benyamini? Mwehapa mundeka ambekya masolu, ndandi Bambo Chapanga nde joampwaghi ahenga bhenibhela. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Iwezikana kubha Bambo Chapanga aweza kughalolakela mahakau ghaghambatike, najombi aweza kunepa ghamboni kwa ndandi ja masolu ghambekewa lalenu.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Bhela nkolongwa Daudi na bhandu bhaki bhokapi bhakajendali na mwanja koni Shimei akabya anjengalela na kunhoma maganga, na kumicha luhombi kunani nahuli lunjendila nkolongwa Daudi. Shimei akabhi ajenda munkeghi ja panani ja chitombi, kulengana na Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Bhela nkolongwa na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu na jombi, bhakahikiki ku nkoka bhakabya bhatondiki. Bhela bhakapomulili pandu panihapa.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu ku muchi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Chikahi hechi, Abisalomu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakapiti ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, najombi Ahitofeli akabhi papamu nabhu. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Bhela Hushai kuhuma ku Aliki, nkochi waka Daudi, akunjendili Abisalomu, na kumpwaghila, “Unkolongwa utama matamu malachu! Unkolongwa utama matamu malachu!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abisalomu akundaluki Hushai, “Bho, aghoghu le nde wamboni waku kwaka nkochi waku Daudi? Bho, mbona ngacheupiti na nkochi waku?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushai akamuyangike, “Ngabhela! Ndandi jola joahaghuliwi na Bambo Chapanga, bhandu abhabha na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, jonihoju nde joanangubha kwaki, na kutama papamu na jombi. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, bho, imbalika nuntumakya nane? Bho, nga mwana waka nkochi wango? Ngati monakuntumaki tati waku, bhenibhela nde moananukutumakya wehapa.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Bhela Abisalomu akumpwaghi Ahitofeli, “Utupekya maholalelu ghaku, bho, tuhenga kyane?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofeli akumpwaghi Abisalomu, “Ughonila na bhatumika bha chimbomba bhaka tati waku bhaabhalekiki nahuli kujighoha nyumba ja kikolongwa. Panihapa bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli anabhajowana kubha uhakaliwi na tati waku, na kwa kuhenga bhenibhela kila mundu joabhi papamu na wehapa anaajeghalika makili.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Bhela, bhandu bhakundenganakili Abisalomu lihema panani ja nhwaghala, najombi akaghoni na bhatumika bha chimbomba bhaka tati waki, koni bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakabya bhumbona.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Mu machobha ghanihagha malobhi ghokapi ghaakabhi apwagha Ahitofeli ghakabhi ngati ghahuma kwaka Chapanga. Na malobhi ghokapi ghaakalongi Ahitofeli ghakapatiki utopelu kwaka Daudi na kwaka Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Hushai ankoloha Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, Ahitofeli akumpwaghi Abisalomu, “Unyetakalya nepani nhaghula bhandu elufu komi na ibheli, nahuli moka nabhu ikilu jenjenu na nukundonda Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Ananumpitalya pwitupwitu na kundapula akabya atondiki na ahekatiki mtima, nanatu ananumpekya choghohi. Bhela bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi papamu naku anabhatilaje. Ananunkoma nkolongwa kanjika jaki, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />na kubhakelebhu bhandu bhangi bhokapi kwaku wehapa. Ngati anatunkomiki mundu jumu ajoju joulonda kunjonanga, anakubhatenda bhandu bhangi bhokapi kubha na lukwali.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Liholalelu leniheli lakabhonakini kubha lamboni kwaka Abisalomu, na kwa ihongozi bhokapi bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Bhela, Abisalomu akapwaghike, “Bhelabhela mundoha na Hushai, Mwaliki, nahuli tujowana najombi apwagha kike.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushai paakahikiki kwaka Abisalomu, Abisalomu akapwaghike, “Ahitofeli nde joabhohiki liholalelu aleli. Bho, tuhenga ngati moapwaghile? Ngati ngabhela, utupekya maholalelu ghaku.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Bhela Hushai akumpwaghi Abisalomu, “Chikai chenjenu, maholalelu ghaabhohiki Ahitofeli nga manyahi. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, Hushai akumpwaghile, ‘Wehapa umanyi kubha tati waku na bhandu bhaki, nde bhakomana ngondo bhabhabhi na makili, nabhombi bhabhi na inyela ngati chinyama cha muchitengu chechilowakeka dubu chechinyaghuliki mwana waki. Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, tati waku nde mkomana ngondo mwana makili, ikilu ngayighoneli papamu na bhandu bhake.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Hata sajenu ajomwili kulihiya mu limbaku limu laki pachilanda ja ghaghabhi konihoku, au pandu pangi. Ngati anabhalonguli kubhalapu na kubhakoma manjolinjoli bhaku, na mondu jokapi jola anaajowini lilobhi leniheli anaapwaghaje, ‘Makomakeku ghapitalili mu lipogha la bhahemba bhaka Abisalomu.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Bhandu bhaku pabhijowana bhenibhela, hata jola joabhi na makili nakanopi, joabhi na mtima ghoubhi na makili ngati wa lihimba, anaahekatika mtima kwa choghoi. Ndandi Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhamanya kubha tati waku nde mundu mwana makili, na bhandu bhokapi bhaabhi nabhu jombi bhabhi na makili. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Bhela liholalelu langu nde kubha, ubhabhongana bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli kutumbu ku muchi wa Dani mbaka ku muchi wa Beeli Sheba, upambala wa kunkachi, bhakubha bhamaheli ngati luhanga lwa mumaheku ja bahali, na wehapa wamwete ubhalonguha kujenda kungondo. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Panihapa nde anatuweza kundapula pandu pokapi pala paibhonikanaje, natatu anatumpitalya kwa kupwitukila ngati lyangami molihabhuki paluhombi. Bhela, njeta mundu hata jumu joanahighalya kubha mwomi, kutumbu jombi mweni papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi papamu naku. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Ngati anaatilili ku muchi wokapi ghola, bhela bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli anabhauyongaluha muchi ghonihoghu kwa ngoji, natatu anatuhutana muchi ghonihoghu mbaka kulibondi, mbaka pilepa kubhonikana chindu chokapi chela hata liganga lichoku la muchi ghonihoghu.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Bhela Abisalomu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakapwaghike, “Liholalelu laka Hushai, Mwaliki, nde lamboni nakanopi kupeta lila laka Ahitofeli.” Maghambu Bambo Chapanga akaholali kulipenga liholalelu linyahi laka Ahitofeli, nahuli kuleta mayonangeku kwaka Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi alakaliwa na kutila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Bhela Hushai akabhapwaghi bhapenganyambiku Sadoki na Abiasali ntundu Ahitofeli, na jombi mweni mobhakumpeki maholalelu Abisalomu, na ihongozi bhokapi bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Henu ntuma bhabholu manyata kwaka Daudi, bhakumpwaghilaje, “Ikilu jenu ngawighone mu ilombukelu ya kuchingwenje, nambu kwa ntundu wokapi ghola ulombukaje, nanga bhela, nkolongwa papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi papamu na jombi anabhayonangikaje.”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Bhela chikahi chenihechi, Yonasani na Ahimaasi bhakabhi bhalendale pambipi na Enilogeli, nahuli ngabhibhonikana na mundu jokapi jola. Najombi mtumika jumu wa chimbomba akabhi ajenda kubhapelake malobhi, nabhombi bhakaghapeliki kwaka nkolongwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Nambu chikahi chenu, nkombu jumu akabhaweni, na akapiti kumpwaghi Abisalomu. Bhela bhokapi bhabheli bhakabhokiki manyata, na kujenda mbaka kunyumba jaka mundu jumu ku Bahulimu hoku. Mundu jonihoju akabhi na chilibha mu liwangala la nyumba jaki. Nabhombi Yonasani na Ahimaasi bhakajingi mu chilibha chenihechi na kujobhalela. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Nhwanu waka mweni nyumba jeniheji akatoliki chifuniku na kuchiyekalela chilibha chenihechi, na kujanika mahunu panani ja chifuniku hechi. Njeta mundu jokapi jola joakalimanyi lijambu leniheli. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Chikahi bhandu bhaka Abisalomu pabhakahikiki kwaka mbomba jonihoju, bhakumpwaghile, “Bho, bhabhi kwaku Ahimaasi na Yonasani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Mbomba jola akabhayangike, “Bhalombwiki chikoka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Bhandu bhaka Abisalomu bhakabhalondike, na pabhakalepali kubhabhona, bhakakelawiki ku muchi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Chikahi bhandu bhanihabha pabhakajomwi kubhoka, Yonasani na Ahimaasi bhakapitiki muchilibha, na kujenda kwaka nkolongwa Daudi kumpwaghi mambu ghanighala ghokapi. Bhakumpwaghile, “Ubhoka manyata, ulombuka kwihi ja nkoka, maghambu Ahitofeli ampekihi maholalelu Abisalomu kwa ndandi jaku.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Bhela, Daudi akabhokiki papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu nabhu, na kulomboka nkoka Yoludani. Pakukahiki lukela njeta mundu hata jumu joakabhi akali ngakulomboka nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="2SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli paakaweni kubha liholalelu laki ngachelijetakaliwi, akatandiki liponda laki, na kubhoka kujenda kunyumba jaki, ku muchi waki. Paakahikiki konihoku, akapangiki wichu mambu gha munyumba jaki, na mweni akatehi kulinyonga. Akapotili na kutaghakika mu litengeli laka tati waki.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Bhela, Daudi akapiti ku muchi wa Mahanaimu. Najombi Abisalomu akalombwiki nkoka Yoludani papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Chikahi chenihechi, Abisalomu akabhi ambekiki Amasa kubha nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli pandu paka Yoabu. Amasa akabhi mwana waka Yitila, mbelakeka wa Bhaishimaeli. Mabhu waki akalowakiki Abigaili, mwali waka Nahashi, joakabhi ndombu waka Seluya, mabhu waka Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Abisalomu papamu na bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakabhekiki likambi labhu ku inchi ja Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Daude pakahikiti ku Mahanaimu, Shobi joakabhili mwana waka Nahashi kuhuma ku Laba ja Bhaamoni, Makili joakabhili mwana waka Amieli kuhuma Lo Debali, na Balizilai, Mgileadi kuhuma ku Logelimu. <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />Bhanihabha bhakaletiki itanda, mabilika, yombu ya lutopi, inganu, shayili, uhembi, bisi, ngondi na dengu, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />busi na mahibha ghaghagandiki, limbeleli na mahibha ghaghagandiki gha ng'ombi, kuhuma mu hinyama yabhu kwa ndandi jaka Daudi papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhaakabhi nabhu. Ndandi bhandu bhakapwaghike, “Bhandu abhabha bhabhi na injala, bhatondiki na bhabhi na inywita kwa ndandi ja kujenda muchingwenje.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Kulepalela na kukomakeka kwaka Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daude akabhongini bhandu bhaakabhili nabhu na kubheka hilongozi bhakolongwa bha manjolinjoli maelufu kwa maia. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Daudi akatumiki manjolinjoli bhaki kungondo mu ikosi itatu: Selusi jimu bhakalonguhiki na Yoabu, selusi ja kabheli bhakalonguhiki na Abishai, mwana waka Seluya, ndongu waka Yoabu, na selusi ja katatu bhakalonguhiki na Itai, Mgiti. Bhela nkolongwa Daudi akabhapwaghi bhokapi, “Nepani namwete ananyenda papamu na mwehapa.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Nambu bhandu bhakapwaghike, “Wehapa ngawibhoka. Maghambu, ngati anatutiliki, bhombi ngabhatuholaleli tepani. Ngati ana nusu jitu anabhapotili, bhelabhela ngabhatuholaleli tepani. Nambu wehapa ubhi na samani ngolongwa hata kupeta bhandu elufu komi pachilanda jitu. Bhela nde mbanga wehapa uhighalya mu muchi, na kutulete ujangatilu kuhuma mu muchi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Nkolongwa akayangike, “Nepani ananhenga lijambu lokapi lela lemwibhona mwehapa kubha lamboni.” Bhela, nkolongwa akajemiki punkeghi ja ndyangu ukolongwa, koni manjolinjoli bhokapi bhakapitaje mu mapogha gha maelufu na mamia. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Nkolongwa akabhalaghalaki Yoabu, Abishai na Itai, akapwaghaje, “Muntendila nkombu jola, Abisalomu kwa chiha kwa ndandi jangu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Bhela, manjolinjoli bhakabhokiki na kujenda pa lubhanja lwa ngondo na kukomana na bhandu bha Izilaeli. Ngondo jeniheji bhakakomini mu chitengu chaka Efulaimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Konihoku manjolinjoli bha Izilaeli bhakalepalili palongi ja manjolinjoli bhaka Daudi. Mu lichobha leniheli bhakakomakiki bhandu bhamaheli namaa, manjolinjoli bhokapi bhabhakakomakiki bhakabhi elufu ishilini. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Ngondo jakajaghani mu inchi jokapi, na bhandu bhamaheli bhakahweli mu chitengu kupeta hata bhandu bhala bhabhakakomakiki kwa lipanga kungondo.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Bhela Abisalomu, koni akabya atami panani ja nyumbu waki, akahimangini na bhatumika bhaka Daudi. Nyumbu jeniheji pajakabhi jipeta pahi ja limbandi likolongwa la nkongu wa mwaloni, mmutu waka Abisalomu ukapatili palimbandi la mwaloni. Abisalomu akahighalili panipala koni ajenjela munani, nambu nyumbu joakabhi atami panani jaki akajendali na mwanja. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Jumu wa bhandu bhanibhala paakaweni lijambu leniheli, akumpwaghi Yoabu, “Lingalyaje, numbweni Abisalomu akajenjala panani ja nkongu wa mwaloni!”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Bhela Yoabu akumpwaghi mundu jonihoju, “Kyani? Ukumbweni Abisalomu? Bho, maghambu kiki ngacheukundapwi pala pala mbaka kuhabhuka pahi paluhombi? Ukahengiki bhenibhela nepani nakabya nukupeki ipandi komi ya madini gha feza na ulamba waka linjolinjoli mwana makili.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Nambu mundu jola akamuyangiki Yoabu, “Hata ngati nakabhi mbatiki ipandi elufu jimu ya madini gha feza mumabhoku ghangu, nganakahatambwi chiwoku changu kwaka mwana waka nkolongwa. Maghambu tukunjowini nkolongwa paakabhi akulaghalaki wehapa na Abishai, papamu na Itai, akapwaghaje, ‘Mundenda nkombu jola, Abisalomu kwa chiha kwa ndandi jangu.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Nanatu ngati nakabhi nuntehi kunkoma, na wala njeta leliweza kuhiyakika kwaka nkolongwa, wehapa wamwete ukabya ulitengiki na nepani.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Bhela Yoabu akapwaghike, “Nepani ngachemi na chikahi cha kuhoa pambani na wehapa.” Panihapa akatoliki mipendi jitamu mumabhoku jaki, na kujenda kunhotola Abisalomu puntima, koni Abisalomu akabya akali mwomi akajenjala panani ja limbandi la nkongu wa mwaloni. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Nabhombi bhatotola silaha komi bhaka Yoabu, bhakahikiki kumuyongalota Abisalomu, bhakundapwili na kunkoma.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Bhela Abisalomu akalapwi lipenenga, nabhombi manjolinjoli bhakakotwiki kubhajengale bhandu bha Izilaeli, maghambu Yoabu akabhi abhahibhalakile. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Bhakuntoliki Abisalomu, na kundekela mu libhomba likolongwa lelakabhi kuchitengu hoku, na kulundika lundu lukolongwa namaa lwa maganga panani jaki. Bhela bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakatiliki, kila mundu ku nyumba jaki mweni.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Chikahi Abisalomu paakabhi akali mwomi, akatoliki nguzu na kujijemeka ku Libondi laka Nkolongwa, ndandi akapwaghiki, “Nepani ngachemi na mwana wa chikambaku wa kulijendaleha lihina langu nahuli ngombukwaje.” Nguzu jeniheji akajipekihi lihina laki, na jakalowakiki, “Nguzu jaka Abisalomu,” mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi apwaghakika kupotela kwaka Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Bhela, Ahimaasi mwana waka Sadoki akapwaghike, “Unyetakya nepani ngembala nakumpwaghila nkolongwa malobhi ghani kubha Bambo Chapanga ankombwili kuhuma mu makili gha maadui bhaki.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoabu akumpwaghi Ahimaasi, “Lalenu wehapa ngaupeleki ubholu. Uweza kupeleka ubholu ghonihoghu mu lichobha lengi. Nambu lalenu ngawipeleki ubholu wokapi ghola, maghambu mwana waka nkolongwa atehi kupotela.” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Bhela Yoabu akumpwaghi mundu jumu Mkushi, “Ujenda ukumpwaghi nkolongwa lijambu lela leuliwene.” Mkushi jola akajinimi kwa utopelu palongu jaka Yoabu, na kubhoka kwa imbelu.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Bhela, Ahimaasi mwana waka Sadoki, akumpwaghi kabhete Yoabu, “Chechibya chibyaje, chondi unyetakyaje na nepani nunkembalya Mkushi jola!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Nambu Yoabu akumpwaghile, “Mwanango, maghambu kiki upala kujenda? Wehapa ngaupati nhupu jokapi jela kwa malobhi ghanihagha.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaasi akapwaghike, “Chechibya chibyaje, nepani mbala kukembela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Bhela Yoabu akumpwaghile, “Haya, ukembalaje.” Panihapa Ahimaasi akakembi imbelu, kwa kujengalela indela ja kuuwanda ja kuchingwenji, na kumpeta Mkushi jola.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Bhela Daudi akabhi atami pachilanda ja milyangu mikolongwa jibheli ja muchi. Najombi mlonda wa ndyangu akakweliki mu lumatu lwa muchi mbaka panani, na paakalolakili wichu mihu ghaki akumbweni mundu akembe imbelu kanjika jaki. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Mlonda jola akajamalili na kumpwaghi nkolongwa. Najombi nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Ngati anaabhi kanjika jaki, lazima kubhi na ubholu.” Najombi mundu jola akajendali kuheghale nakanopi.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Mlonda jola akumbweni mundu jongi akembela, akundohiki kabhete mlonda wa ndyangu, akapwaghaje, “Lingalyaje, kubhi kabhete na mundu jongi atenda kuhika koni akembe imbelu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Bhelabhela lazima anaakubha aleta ubholu unyahi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Mlonda jola akapwaghike, “Mona kubha wa kutumbula jola akembe ngati Ahimaasi mwana waka Sadoki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Jombi nde mundu wamboni, aleta ubholu wamboni.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Bhela Ahimaasi akundohiki nkolongwa, akapwaghaje, “Mambu ghokapi nde ghamboni!” Akachikimi na kujinama palongi jaka nkolongwa, akapwaghaje, “Alumbalikaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, joakukombwi wehapa kuhuma kwa bhandu bhabhakwehiki mabhoku ghabhu kukupenga wehapa, wa bambo wangu nkolongwa!”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Bhela nkolongwa akalalukile, “Bho, nkombu Abisalomu hoju le alama?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimaasi akayangike, “Chikahi Yoabu paakandumiki nepani nuntumika waku, nakaweni kukabhi na manjobhela ghamaheli, nambu ngachenamanyi ndandi jaki.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Najombi nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Ujema punkeghi, na ulendalya panihapa.” Bhela akaheghali punkeghi na kujema panihapa.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Bhela Mkushi jola akahikiki na kupwagha, “Kubhi na ubholu wamboni, wa bambo wangu nkolongwa! Maghambu lalenu Bambo Chapanga akukombwili kuhuma mu makili gha bhandu bhokapi bhabhakajinwiki nahuli kukupenga wehapa.” <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Nkolongwa akundaluki nkombu jola, “Bho, nkombu Abisalomu le alama?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Mkushi jola akayangike, “Maadui bhaku wehapa, wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, papamu na bhokapi bhabhajinuka nahuli kukuyonanga wehapa, na bhakubha ngati nkombu Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Panihapa nkolongwa akabhaghiji namaa. Akajingi mu chumba chechakabhi panani ja ndyangu ukolongwa na kulela. Paakabhi akwela, akabhi alela koni akapwaghaje, “Wa mwanangu Abisalomu, wa mwanangu Abisalomu! Ngati nakabya mbotili pandu paku wehapa! Abisalomu wa mwanangu! Wa mwanango!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu andakali nkolongwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Bhela Yoabu akapwaghakiki, “Nkolongwa Daudi alela na kuombuleza kwa ndandi jaka Abisalomu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Bhela, kuweza kungondo kwa lichobha lenilela kukang'anambwiki kubha maombulezu kwa bhandu bhokapi, maghambu bhandu bhakajowini kubha nkolongwa andele mwana waki Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Mu lichobha lenilela, bhandu bhakajingi mu muchi chinunu ngati bhandu mobhajingali mu muchi kwa iyoni, kwa ndandi ja kutila ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Nkolongwa akayekali pamihu jaki na kulela kwa sauti ngolongwa, akapwaghaje, “Wenga wa mwanangu Abisalomu! Wa mwanangu Abisalomu! Abisalomu!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Bhela Yoabu akajingi munyumba jaka nkolongwa, na kupwagha, “Lalenu utupeki iyoni tepani tabhatumika bhaku bhokapi, tetughakengali matamu ghaku, matamu gha bhana bhaku bha chikambaku, matamu gha bhana bhaku bha chimbomba, matamu gha akabhahanu bhaku na matamu gha bhatumika bhaku bha chimbomba. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Wehapa ubhapala bhala bhabhakuhakalila, na ubhahakali bhala bhabhakupala. Lalenu utulangihi hotu hotu kubha manjolinjoli bhaku bhakolongwa ngachetubhi na ndandi jokapi jela kwaku. Mona kubha lalenu, ngati Abisalomu akabhi mwoni, na tepani tabhokapi tukabhi tutehi kupotela, wehapa ukabya uhekalile. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Bhela sajenu, upita kunja ukabhajeghala mtima bhandu bhaku. Ndandi napa kwaka Bambo Chapanga kubha, ngati ngaujendi kulonge nabhu, njeta hata jumu joanahighalya papamu na wehapa mbaka kuhika pakamihi ja lalenu. Haleli analikubha lijambu lihakau nakanopi kwaku wehapa kupeta mahakau ghokapi ghaghalabhali kukupata kutumbu ukombu waku mbaka sajenu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Bhela, nkolongwa akapitiki, na kujenda kutama pachitehu chaki pambipi na ndyangu ukolongwa wa muchi. Bhandu pabhakapwaghakiki, “Nkolongwa atami pundyungu ukolongwa wa muchi,” bhokapi bhakunjendile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Daudi akelabhuka ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Chikahi chenihechi Bhaizilaeli bhakabhi bhakembalili kila mundu kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Bhandu bha makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli, bhakabhi bhatenda kujojalanela bheni kwa bheni, bhakapwaghaje, “Nkolongwa Daudi akatukengalili kuhuma makili gha maadui bhitu, jombi nde joakatukengalili kuhuma mu makili gha Bhafilisti. Nambu sajenu ajitiliki inchi jenjenu kwa ndandi jaka Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Najombi Abisalomu, jotukumpakiki mahuta nahuli akaubha nkolongwa witu, akomakiki kungondo. Henu maghambu kiki ngachetukolabhake lijambu lokapi lela panani ja kunkelabhu nkolongwa Daudi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Bhela nkolongwa Daudi akatumiki ubholu aghoghu kwa bhapenganyambiku Sadoki na Abiasali, kupwagha, “Mubhalalukya ihongozi bha Yuda, ‘Bho, maghambu kiki bhombi bhakubha nde bha kujomukela kunkelabhu nkolongwa kunyumba jake? Kwa kubha malobhi gha bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli ghanhikili nepani nunkolongwa, nahuli kungelabhu nepani kunyumba jangu. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Mwehapa nde bhalongu bhangu, inyama jangu na mwahi wangu namwete. Henu maghambu kiki mkubha bha kujomukela kungelabhu kabhete nepani nunkolongwa kunyumba?’ ” <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Bhelabhela mumpwaghila Amasa, “Bho, wehapa le nga undongu wangu wa pambipe? Chapanga na angomaje ngati nepani nganuntendi jombi kubha linjolinjoli wangu nkolongwa kutumbu lalenu pandu paka Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Bhela, Daudi akajihutiki mitima ja bhandu bhokapi bha Yuda, ngati mundu jumu. Panihapa bhakumpelaki ubholu, kupwagha, “Ukelabhuka kunyumba, wehapa na bhatumika bhaku bhokapi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Bhela, nkolongwa akakelawiki, na kuhika mbaka pu nkoka ya Yoludani. Nabhombi bhandu bhokapi bha Yuda bhakahikiki mbaka ku Giligali nahuli kujenda kunjopalela nkolongwa, na kundomboha nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Najombi Shimei mwana waka Gela, Mbenyamini, kuhuma ku muchi wa Bahulimu, akajombatiki papamu na bhandu bha Yuda nahuli kunjopale nkolongwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimei akapiti papamu na Bhabenyamini elufu jimu. Najombi Siba, mtumika wa bhandu bha munyumba jaka Sauli, papamu na bhana bhaki komi, na bhatumika ishilini, bhakapiti manyata ku nkoka Yoludani, nahuli kundongule nkolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Bhela, bhakalombwiki pa chilomboku nahuli kubhajangati bhandu bha munyumba jaka nkolongwa, na kubhalomboha na kutenda kila chindu cheakapaliki nkolongwa. Shimei mwana waka Gela, paakalombwiki nkoka Yoludani, akachikimi na kujinama ukutama palongi jaka nkolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Shimei akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Bambo wangu, chondi nukulobha ngawimalangi uhakau wala kukomboka lihoku lenakahengiki mu lichobha lela paukabhi ubhoka mu muchi wa Yelusalemu. Nukulobha ngaughabheka ghanighala muntima waku. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Kwa ndandi nepani mtumika waku manyi kubha ndendiki lihoku. Nde ndandi lalenu mili wa kutumbula kuhuma mu likabila laka Yusufu, kuhika kukujopale wehapa wa bambo wangu, nkolongwa.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Bhela Abishai mwana waka Seluya akapwaghike, “Bho, Shimei le ngacheapalika kukomakeka, kwa kubha akumpeki masolu mpakwa mahuta waka Bambo Chapanga?”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Nambu Daudi akapwaghike, “Mwenga mabhana bhaka Seluya, bho, nepani mi na kyani na mwehapa? Lalenu mbi maadui bhangu! Bho, lalenu kubhi na jokapi jola joanakumakika mu Izilaeli? Bho, nepani le ngachemanyi kubha lalenu nepani nde nunkolongwa wa Izilaeli jokapi?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Bhela nkolongwa akumpwaghi Seluya, “Wehapa ngaukomakeki.” Najombi nkolongwa akundaghi Shimei kwa kulapa.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Bhelabhela Mefibosheti nchokolu waka Sauli, akahelili kujenda kunjopale nkolongwa Daudi. Kutumbu lichobha lela nkolongwa paakabhokiki mu Yelusalemu mbaka paakakelawiki lukwali, Mefibosheti ngacheakagholwi magholu ghaki, kumogha indehu yaki, wala kuchapa ingobhu yaki. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Chikahi paakabhokiki ku Yelusalemu kujenda kunjopale nkolongwa, nkolongwa akumpwaghile, “Mefibosheti, bho, maghambu kiki ngachewapiti papamu na nepani?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefibosheti akapwaghike, “Wenga wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, mtumika wangu akatehi kungolowa. Ndandi nepani nuntumika waku nakumpwaghile, ‘Undandakya liponda langu, nahuli ndama panani jaki, nyendaje papamu na nkolongwa.’ Maghambu nepani nuntumika waku nde chilema wa magholu. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Najombi akahikiki kungopunganela kwaku wehapa wa bambo wangu nkolongwa. Nambu wehapa wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, ubhi ngati mtumika waka kunani kwaka Chapanga. Bhela utenda lijambu lokapi lela leubhona kubha nde lamboni kwaku. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Bhabhelakeka bhokapi bhaka tati wangu ngacheitupalika chindu chengi chokapi chela kuhuma kwaku nambu pe kukomakeka palongi jaku, wa bambo wangu nkolongwa. Nambu ukambeki nepani nuntumika waku mbekenyu pachilanda ja bhala bhabhakabhi bhakula pameza jaku. Bho, mi le haki jokapi jela ja kundele nkolongwa nakanopi ja ghanihagha?” <verse eid="2SA 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Nkolongwa akayangike, “Bho, maghambu kiki ukolabheka nanope? Naghalaki wehapa na Siba ngabhana inchi jeniheji.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Bhela Mefibosheti akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Umpwaghila atola kila chindu, maghambu sajenu bambo wangu nkolongwa, akelawiki kunyumba lukwali.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Balizilai, Mgileadi bhelabhela najombi akahelili kuhuma ku Logelimu, nahuli kujenda kulomboka nkoka Yoludani papamu na nkolongwa, na kunhindakila mbaka kwihi ja nkoka. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Najombi Balizilai akabhi asejiki namaa, akabhi na hyaka semanini. Akabhi ampekihi nkolongwa ghala ghaaghapala nkolongwa mu chikahi chokapi paakabhi atama ku Mahanaimu hoku, ndandi akabhi na hindu yamaheli namaa. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Bhela, nkolongwa akumpwaghi Balizilai, “Tamboka papamu na nepani ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, nanatu ananukughoha konihoku.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Nambu Balizilai akamuyangiki nkolongwa, “Bho, mile na hyaka hingi ya kutama, mbaka nyenda papamu na wehapa unkolongwa mbaka ku muchi wa Yelusalemu? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Sajenu nepani mi na hyaka semanini. Bho, nhweza le kulekanisha pachilanda ja lelibhi lamboni na lelibhi lihakau? Bho, nepani nuntumika waku le nhweza kumanya kunogha kwa chilebhi chela chengula au chengunywa? Bho, nakali le nhweza kujowanela sauti ya bhajemba bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba? Bho, maghambu kiki nepani mtumika waku nyonjukya chibwahila kwaka bambo wangu nkolongwa? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Nepani mtumika waku ananombuka nkoka Yoludani papamu na wehapa unkolongwa kwa lujendu lujipi pela, nambu maghambu kiki nkolongwa umbeke nhupu ngolongwa ntundu aghoghu? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Nukulobha, nepani nutumika waku, unyetakyaje nhwelila mu muchi wangu, pambipi na litengeli laka tati wangu na mabhu wangu. Nambu mtumika waku Kimhamu ajoju, unjetakya ajenda papamu na wehapa wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, na ukuntendila jombi lijambu lokapi lela lewibhona kubha nde lamboni.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Bhela nkolongwa akumpwaghi Balizilai, “Kimhamu anaalombuka nkoka Yoludani papamu na nepani, nanatu ananunhengila lokapi lela leanalukunyambiha wehapa. Nanau chindu chokapi chela chewipala kuhuma kwangu nepani, ananukutendilaje.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Panihapa bhandu bhokapi bhakalombwiki nkoka Yoludani, najombi nkolongwa akalombwike. Nkolongwa akunjobhatili na kumpengalela Balizilai, najombi Balizilai akabhujiki kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhayuda na Bhaizilaeli bhalochana kwa ndandi jaka nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Bhela nkolongwa akalombwiki, na kujenda mbaka ku Gileadi, Kimhamu najombi akapiti papamu na nkolongwa. Nabhombi bhandu bhokapi bha Yuda na nusu ja bhandu bha Izilaeli, bhakunhindaki nkolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Pachapetiki chikahi kichokopi, bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakunjendi nkolongwa, na kumpwaghila, “Bho, maghambu kiki bhalongu bhitu, bhandu bha Yuda, bhunkelawihi nkolongwa kwa kulihiya panga kutupwaghila, na kundomboha kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, jombi na bhandu bha munyumba jaki, papamu na bhandu bhokapi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Bhela bhandu bhokapi bha Yuda bhakabhayangiki bhandu bha Izilaeli, “Tukahengiki bhenibhela maghambu nkolongwa nde ndongu witu wa pambipi. Bho, maghambu kiki muyoma kubhokana na lijambu leniheli? Bho, tepani le tukuliki chindu mu chikahi chokapi chela kwa malepu ghaka nkolongwa? Au, bho, atupeki le nhupu wokapi ghola?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Panihapa bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakabhayangiki bhandu bha Yuda, bhakapwaghaje, “Tepani tubhi na haki mala komi panani jaka nkolongwa Daudi, kupeta yembi nayu mwehapa. Henu maghambu kiki mtujojoha? Bho, tepani le ngachetabhi bha kutumbula kupwagha kubha nkolongwa witu akelabhuka kunyumba?” Malobhi gha bhandu bha Yuda ghakabhi makali kupeta malobhi gha bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba ang'anambuka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Bhela, ku Giligali hoku kukabhi na mundu jumu muhakau namaa lihina laki akalowakiki Sheba mwana waka Bikili, Mbenyamini. Jombi akalapwi lipenenga na kujamali kwa sauti, akapwaghaje, “Ngachetubhi na pandu kwaka Daudi, wala ngachetubhi na pandu kwaka mwana waka Yese! Kila mundu ajendaje ku nyumba jaki, mwenga mabhandu bha Izilaeli!” <verse eid="2SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Bhela bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakundekiki Daudi na kunjengale Sheba joakabhi mwana waka Bikili. Nambu bhandu bha Yuda bhakabhi pambipi na nkolongwa wabhu mu mwanja wokapi kutumbu ku nkoka Yoludani mbaka kuhika ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Bhela chikahi Daudi paakakelawiki ku nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa ku Yelusalemu hoku, akabhatoliki bhatumika bha chimbomba komi bhaakabhi abhalekiki nahuli kujighoha nyumba ja kikolongwa na kubhabheka mkati ja nyumba najengi pahi ja ulingalilu wa manjolinjoli. Akabhaghohiki wichu, nambu ngacheakaghoni nabhu kihyegha. Akabhabhekiki muchifungu, na kutama ngati bhabhahweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu mbaka pabhakpotile.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Bhela nkolongwa akumpwahi Amasa, “Ubhaloha bhandu bha Yuda bhahika pambani kwa machobha ghatatu, na wehapa wamwete ukubhaje.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Bhela Amasa akapiti kubhaloha bhandu bha Yuda, nambu mweni akakabhaki kukelabhuka mu chikahi chela cheakabhekiki nkolongwa. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daudi akumpwghi Abishai, “Henu, Sheba mwana waka Bikili, anaatuletila mang'ahiku nakanopi kuliku moakahengi Abisalomu. Ubhatola bhandu bhaka bambu waku na undondaje, nanga bhela anapata muchi ghoubhi na ngomi na kututila.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Bhela bhandu bha Yoabu, na Bhakeleti na Bhapelesi, papamu na bhakomana ngando bhabhabhi na makili bhokapi bhakabhokiki pahi ja ulonguheku waka Abishai. Bhakabhokiki ku Yelusalemu nahuli kundonda Sheba, mwana waka Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Pabhakahiki ku litalaghu likolongwa ku Gibeoni hoku, Amasa akahikiki kubhajopalela. Yoabu akabhi awati ingobhu yaki ya kinjolinjoli, panani jaki akakongiki ulamba muchibhunu ghoukabhi na lipanga mkati ja ala. Paakabhi ajenda palongi, lipanga lela lakahawiki pahi kuhuma mu ala. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu akumpwaghi Amasa, “Ujumwiki bholi, ndongu wango?” Bhela Yoabu akunkamwi Amasa indeu kwa chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu nahuli ambuswaje. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Nambu Amasa ngacheakaliweni lipanga lelakabhi mu mabhoku ghaka Yoabu, najombi Yoabu akunhotwi nalu mulutumbu, naghombi matumbu ghaki ghakapitiki kunja, na kupotela. Yoabu ngacheakunhotwi mala pabheli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Bhela, Yoabu na ndongu waki Abishai bhakajendali kundonda Sheba, mwana waka Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Jumu wa bhandu bhaka Yoabu akajemiki pambipi na hyegha jaka Amasa, na kupwagha, “Jokapi joampala Yoabu, na jokapi joampala Daudi, na anjengalyaje Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa akabhi aghalabhuka pa mwahi waki pachilanda ja indela ngolongwa, mundu jumu akaweni kubha lipogha lokapi la manjolinjoli lakabhi lijemiki panipala. Mundu hoju paakaweni kubha kila mundu joahika pandu panipala paakabhi Amasa akatehi kujema, akunhutini Amasa kuhuma pa indela ngolongwa pala mbaka kungonda, na kuhyekalela ingobhu panani jaki. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Pabhakajomwi kubhoha hyegha jaka Amasa pa indela pala, bhandu bhokapi bhakapiti papamu na Yoabu kundonda Sheba, mwana waka Bikili.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba akapetiki mu makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli mbaka ku muchi wa Abeli ja Beti Maaka na kupeta pandu pokapi pa Bhabikili ambabhu bhakalibhongini papamu na kunjengalela. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Mapogha ghokapi gha ikosi yaka Yoabu yakahikiki na kumuyongolota Sheba, mwana waka Bikili ku muchi wa Abeli ja Beti Maaka hoku. Bhakauyongalwiti muchi kwa kubheka lipogha la manjolinjoli, nahuli kubombola lumatu na kuluhabhu pahi. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Bhela, mbomba jumu joakabhi na mbulahu akajowaniki akapwaghaje kuhuma mu muchi, “Njowanyaje! Njowanyaje! Mumpwaghila Yoabu ahika pambani nahuli nongila naku.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu akapiti palongi jaka mbomba hoju, najombi mbomba hoju akundalukile, “Bho, wehapa le wa Yoabu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Yoabu akayangike, “Ena, nde nepani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Mbomba jola akumpwaghile, “Unyowanya malobhi ghanukupwaghi nepani nuntumika waku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Yoabu akumpwaghile, “Nukujowanela.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Mbomba hoju akajendali kupwagha, “Pamwandi hapa bhandu bhakabhi bhapwagha, ‘Bhakalonda mbulau ku muchi wa Abeli hoku.’ Bhenibhela nde ntundu bhandu mobhakawezi kujomo lijambu leling'aha. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Nepani nde jumu wa bhandu bhala bhabhapala lukwali na ulongwana mu Izilaeli. Henu wehapa upala kuyonanga muchi ambahu nde ngati mabhu mu Izilaeli. Bho, maghambu kiki henu upala kuuyonanga muchi waka Bambo Chapanga mweni?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu akayangike, “Lijembu leniheli likubha kutali na nepani ng'o. Nepani ngachemi na ndandi ja kuumila wala kuuyonanga! <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Lilobhi leniheli ngachelibhi bhenibhela. Nambu mundu jumu kuhuma ku itombi yaka Efulaimu joalowakeka Sheba mwana waka Bikili, apala kumpenga nkolongwa Daudi. Mumpiha jonihoju kwangu nepani nanatu anamoka mu muchi ghoni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Mbomba jola akumpwaghi Yoabu, “Mmutu waki anamlekaliwa kunja kwa kupete panani ja lumatu lwa muchi.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Bhela, mbomba jonihoju akapiti kwa bhandu bhokapi mu muchi kwa mbolau yaki. Bhakunhekiti mmutu Sheba mwana waka Bikili, na kuhoma kunja kwaka Yoabu. Bhela, Yoabu akalapwi lipenenga, na kubhapechangana bhandu bhaki kuhuma mu muchi ghonihoghu, kila jumu wabhu akapiti kunyumba jaki. Bhela Yoabu akakelawiki kwaka nkolongwa, ku muchi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhajangatila bhaka nkolongwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yoabu akabhi linjolinjoli nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli bhokapi bha Izilaeli, Benaya, mwana waka Yehoyada, akabhi chiongozi wa Bhakeleti na Bhapeleti. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adolamu akabhi chiongozi wa bhabhakabhi bhahenga lihengu la kujomalakewa, na Yehoshafati, mwana waka Ahihudi, akabhi mlemba wa kombukombu. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sheva akabhi mlemba, Sadoki na Abiasali bhakabhi bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Najombi Ila, kuhuma ku muchi wa Yaili, akabhi mpenganyambiku waka Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Kukomakeka kwa bhabhelakeka bhaka Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Chakahi cha utawala waka Daudi kukabhi na injala kwa hyaka itatu ya kulongana, bhela Daudi akundobhiki Bambo Chapanga. Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Nde kwa ndandi jaka Sauli na bhandu bha munyumba jaki bhakabhi na mahoku gha kukoma, kwa ndandi akabhakomiki Bhagibeoni.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Nkolongwa akabhalohiki Bhagibeoni na kulonge nabhu. Bhagibeoni ngachebhakabhi bhana bha Izilaeli, nambu bhakabhi mahighalilu gha Bhaamoli. Bhaizilaeli bhakabhi bhalapiki kubhaleka bhomi, nambu Sauli kwa wihu waki kwa ndandi ja Izilaeli na Yuda, akalengiki kubhayonanga. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Daudi akabhalaluki Bhagibeoni, “Bho, nuntendila kike? Ndenda chindu bholi nahuli kutenda ujonganeshu, na mpata kujipengalela inchi jenjenu na bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga?”<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Bhagibeoni bhakayangike, “Lijambu litu tepani na Sauli papamu na bhandu bha munyumba jaki nga kwa ndandi ja madini gha feza au zahabu. Wala nga kwa ndandi jitu tepani kupala kunkoma mundu jokapi jola mu Izilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Nkolongwa akabhalaluki kabhete, “Bho, henu mpala nuntendila kike?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Bhombi bhakamuyangiki nkolongwa, “Sauli akaholali kutukoma tepani na kutuyonanga, akapaliki ngaandeka mundu witu jokapi jola mu pandu pokapi pa Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Bhela, utupekya bhana bhaki saba bha chikambaku nahuli tukabhakoma palanga palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga ku chitombi cha Gibea jaka Sauli, joakahaghuliwi na Bambo Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Bhela nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Ananumpekyaje.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Nambu nkolongwa akumuhiiki Mefibosheti, mwana waka Yonasani, nchokolu waka Sauli, ndandi akabhi alapiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, pachilanda jaka Daudi na Yonasani, mwana waka Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Nambu nkolongwa akabhatoliki bhana bhabheli ambabhu Lisipa, mwali waka Ahiya, akumbelaki Sauli, yani Alimoni na Mefibosheti, papamu na bhana bhokapi nhwanu bha chikambaku bhaka Mikali, mwali waka Sauli, ambabhu akumbelaki Adilieli mwana waka Balizilai, kuhuma ku Meholati. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Bhana bhanihabha saba bha chikambaku Daudi akabhapekihi Bhagibeoni, nabhombi bhakabhajenjihi pachitombi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na bhokapi saba bhakapoti papamu. Bhana bhanihabha bhakakomakiki mu utumbulilu wa mahunu gha shayili.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Bhela, Lisipa mwali waka Ahiya akatoliki ingobhu ja ligunila, na kulitandakila panini ja litalaghu. Lisipa akatami panihapa kutumbu utumbulilu wa mahunu mbaka chikahi cha iyula pajakatonyiki panani ja hyegha ya bhandu bhabhakomakiki habha. Chikahi chenihechi chokapi Lisipa ngacheakailekiki hijuni ya kunani kuigusa hyegha heyi chikahi cha muhi, wala hinyama ya muchitengu chikahi cha ikilu.<verse eid="2SA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Bhela chikahi Daudi paakapwaghakiki chela cheakahengiki Lisipa mwali waka Ahiya, mtumika wa chimbomba waka Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />akapiti kuitola ihupa yaka Sauli na mwana waki Yonasani kuhuma kwa bhandu bha ku Yabeshi Gileadi. Bhakaitoliki kwa kulihiya kuhuma ku lubhanja lwa bhandu bhokapi bha ku Beti Shani hoku, pandu ambapu Bhafilisiti bhakabhi bhabhajenjihi pabhakajomwi kukomakeka na Sauli ku chitombi cha Giboa hoku. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Daudi akailetiki ihupa yaka Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki, kuhuma konihoku, bhelabhela bhakaibhongini ihupa ya akakombu saba bhabhakabhi bhakomakiki na kuhomekwa panani. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Bhela, bhandu bhaka Daudi bhakaitaghiki ihupa yaka Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki, mu litengeli laka Kishi, tati waka Sauli, ku Sela hoku mu inchi jaka Benyamini. Nabhombi bhakahengiki kila chindu ngati moakalaghalaki nkolongwa. Paghakapetiki ghanihagha, Chapanga akaghayangiki malobhu kwa ndandi ja inchi jabhu.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondo na mibhandu ja Bhafilisti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 20:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Bhela Bhafilisti bhakakomini kabhete na Bhaizilaeli. Najombi Daudi papamu na bhandu bhaki bhakahelili nahuli kukomana na Bhafilisti. Daudi akatondiki namaa mu lichobha leniheli. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Najombi Ishi Benobu, jumu wa bhabhelakeka bha Bhalefai, ambaju kutopa kwa nkoha waki wa shaba ukabbhi kilu itatu na nusu, akabhi alikongiki lipanga lahenu, na akapwaghiki kubha anaankoma Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Nambu Abishai mwana waka Seluya, akapiti kunkengale Daudi. Abishai akundapwi Mfilisti jola na kunkoma. Bhela, bhandu bhakundapi Daudi, bhakapwaghaje, “Ngawijendi kabhete na tepani kungondo, nanga bhela anauchuchuha taa ja ukolongwa mu Izilaeli.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Paghakapetiki ghanihagha, kukapitali kabhete ngondo na Bhafilisti ku Gobu hoku. Konihoku Sibekai, kuhuma mu lukolu lwaka Hushati, akunkomiki Safu, joakabhi jumu wa bhabhelakeka bha Bhaalefai.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Panakatai, kukapitali kabhete ngondo na Bhafilisti ku Gobu hoku. Najombi Elihanani mwana waka Yaili, kuhuma ku Beselehemu, akunkomiki Goliati, Mgiti, ambaju mpini wa nkoha waki ukabhi ngati waka mloka.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Panakatai, kukapitali kabhete ngondo ku Gati. Konihoku kukabhi na mundu jumu ndachu namaa, mundu jonihoju akabhi na ngonji sita mu kila libhoku ghaki, na ngonji sita mu kila ligholu laki, yokapi ikabhi ngonji ishilini na ncheche. Jonihoju najombi akabhi mbelakeka wa Bhalefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Jonihoju najombi paakabhatondwi Bhaizilaeli, Yonasani mwana waka Shama, ndongu waka Daudi, akunkomike.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Bhafilisti bhokapi ncheche habha bhakabhi mimundu ku muchi wa Gati hoku, nabhombi bhakakomakiki na Daudi, papamu na bhatumika bhaki.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Lujembu lwa kuweza lwaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="PSA 18">Zabuli 18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Bhela Daudi akunjembili Bambo Chapanga malobhi gha lujembu alolu ambapu Bambo Chapanga paakunkengalili kuhuma kwaka maadui bhaki bhokapi, kabheti kuhuma kwaka Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Bhela akapwaghike, “Bambo Chapanga nde litalaghu langu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">ngomi jangu, na mkengalela wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Chapanga wangu nde litalaghu langu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">ambaju kwaki ngembalela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Ngau jangu na linyelu la ukombola wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Jombi nde ngomi jangu, likembalelu langu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">na nkombola wangu,<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Nundoha Bambo Chapanga, jombi joapalika kulumbaliwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">nanatu ngengalewa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">kuhuma kwa maadui bhangu!”<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />“Majegha gha kupotela ghakaniyongalwiti, machi ghamaheli gha kupwitukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">gha uyonangeku ghakaniyekiti.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Mighoji ja kuwawa jakaniyongalwiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">miteghu ja kupotela ikangembalili.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mu mang'ahiku ghangu nakundohiki Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">nakundohiki Chapanga wangu kwa ujangatilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Kuhuma mu Nyumba jaki akajowini sauti jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">na chilelu changu chakunhikili mumakutu ghaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Ndema ukabhaghiji na kunyukanyuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">misingi ja kunani kumahundi jakatehi kunyukanyuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">yakatehi kunyukanyuka maghambu Chapanga akatehi kuhakalila!<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Lyohi lakahukiki kuhuma muimbulu jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">moto ghouyonanga ukapitiki mundomu waki, na makalakala gha moto ghakalipwiki kuhuma kwaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Chapanga akakutendiki kunani kumahundi kujinama, na akaheli pahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">na mahundi mapili ghakabhi pahi ja magholu ghaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Akatami panani ja ihumbi yeibhi na mapapanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">na kugholoka kunani kwa mapapanilu gha mpongu.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Akaliyongalutili lubhendu lihema laki la kumuyongolota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">chiyekalelu chaki chakabhi mahundi makolongwa gha kunani na malundikanu gha machi.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Kubhokana na unang'anu ghoukabhi palongi jaki, makalakala gha moto ghakapambakike.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Bambo Chapanga akalundamili kuhuma kunani kumahunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">na sauti jaka Joabhi Kunani Nakanopi jakajowanike.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Akalapwi mipendi na kubhagabhanya maadui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">akabhahomi unang'anu wa chitobhi na kubhatopola.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Bambo Chapanga paakabhakenjukili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kubhokana na mbomu ja muimbulu jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">mabondi gha bahali ghakayekuliwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">na misingi ja ndema jakabhonakine.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Akahatambwi chibhoku chaki kuhuma kunani kumahundi na kungamula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">na kumoha kuhuma mu machi ghamaheli.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Akangengalili kuhuma kwaka adui wangu joabhi na makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">akangengalili kuhuma kwa bhandu bhabhanhakalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">maghambu bhakabhi na makili ghamaheli kupeta nepani.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Bhakanhikili kunapula mu lichobha panakabhi mu mang'ahiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">nambu Bambo Chapanga akabhi ujangatilu wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Akanetiki kunja pandu papabhi na lukwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">akangengalili kwa kubha akanyambakiki na nepani.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />Bambo Chapanga akandendili kulengana na ulongwana wango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">akambeki nhupu ndandi mabhoku ghangu ngacheghakabhi na lihakau.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Kwa ndandi nakaikamwi indela yaka Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">wala ngachenundekiki Chapanga wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Ndandi shelia yaki yokapi ibhi palongi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">wala ngachengotwiki kughajengalela malaghalakilu ghaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Ngachemi na lihakau palongi jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">na nililendiki nahuli nganitenda mahoku.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Bambo Chapanga anepiki kulengana na ulongwana wango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">kwa kubha amanyi kubha ngechemi na lihakau palongi jaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Kwaka mundu joabhi ndongwana ulangiha ulongwana kwaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">na ulangiha wamboni kwaka mundu wamboni.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Wehapa unkamilifu kwaka mundu joabhi mkamilifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">nambu ulangi ukatile kwaka mundu muhakau.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Wehapa ubhakengalela bhandu bhabhabhonewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">nambu mihu ghaku ghabhalolakela bhabhabhi na ing'omu, nahuli kubhaheleya.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, nde taa jango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">na Bambo Chapanga alumulakila lubhendu lwango.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Kwa ujangatilu waku nhweza kughatopola manjolinjoli gha maadui bhango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">anami papamu na Chapanga wangu, nhweza kuhomba lumatu.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Indela yaka Chapanga nde ikamilike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">chilanga chaka Bambo Chapanga nde chakuhobhaleka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">Jombi nde ngau jabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">bhokapi bhabhunkembale jombi.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Bho, nde nane joabhi Chapanga, nambu pe Bambo Chapanga kanjika jake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Bho, nde nane joabhi litalaghu, nambu pe Chapanga wito?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Chapanga nde ngomi jangu jejibhi na makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">na ajitendiki indela jangu kubha lukwale.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Aghatendiki magholu ghangu kubha ngati gha chinyama kulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">na anyangatili kujema pandu pangu papajinwike.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Aghabholiki mabhoku ghangu kukomana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">hata mabhoku ghangu ghaweza kuupenda upendi wa shaba.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Umbekihi ngau ja ukengaleku waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">kwa ujangatilu waku ungwehiki nepani.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Unenganakili mbekenyu indela jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">nahuli magholu ghangu ngaghinyelambuka.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Nakabhajengalili maadui bhangu na kubhayonanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">ngachenakelawiki kunyuma mbaka pabhakayonangike.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Nakabhayoningi, na kubhahabhu pahi nahuli ngabhiweza kujema kabhete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">Ena, bhakahawiki pahi ja magholu ghango.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Wehapa ukanyangatili makili gha kukomana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">bhela ukabhatendiki maadui bhangu kujinama palongi jangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Ukabhatendiki maadui bhangu bhang'anambukaje na kutila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">nahuli bhala bhabhanhakalila nabhayonangaje.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Bhakalondiki ujangatilu, nambu ngachepakabhi na mundu wa kubhajangatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">bhakundeli Bambo Chapanga, nambu ngacheakabhayangike.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Nakabhatimbiki ngati luhombi lwa ndema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">nakabhakanyiti na kubhapechangana ngati makandu gha muindela.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Wehapa ungengalili kubhokana na malapuliku gha bhandu bhango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">unendiki nepani nahuli ngubha ngati chiongozi wa inchi yokapi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Bhandu ambabhu ngachenabhamanyi bhatenda kundumakila.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Bhagheni anabhahika kuliheleya kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">na kwa kujowana pela malobhi ghangu bhakatehi kunitii.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Nabhombi bhagheni anabhapotila mtima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">bhakapitiki kuhuma mu ngomi yabhu koni bhabhaghaja.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />Bambo Chapanga abhi mwomi! Alumbalikaje Litalaghu langu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Alumbalikaje Bambo Chapanga, Litalaghu la ukengaleku wango.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Jombi anyangatili kubhalapula maadui bhangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">na kubhabheka bhandu bha inchi nayengi pahi jango.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Angengalili kuhuma kwa maadui bhango.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 22:49" />
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, ungwehiki panani ja maadui bhango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">na ungengalili kuhuma kwa bhandu bhabhabhi na ing'omo.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Bhela, ananukulumbalyaje wa Bambo Chapanga, pachilanda ja inchi nayengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">nanatu ananilijemba lihina lako.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Chapanga ampekeha nkolongwa joanhawili ukengaleku ukolongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">andangiha chiha chaki jola joanhimiki kubha nkolongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">ena, kwaka Daudi na bhabhelakeka bhaki mileli.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Malobhi gha kujomulela ghaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Aghagha nde malobhi gha kujomulela ghaka Daudi: Nde ubholu waka Daudi mwana waka Yese, ubholu waka mundu ambaju Chapanga akuntendiki akubha nkolongwa. Chapanga waka Yakobo akunhawi Daudi kubha nkolongwa, na malobhi ghaki Bhaizilaeli bhakahekalili kughajemba.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />Roho waka Bambo Chapanga akalongi kupete kwangu nepani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">na akaghabhekiki malobhi ghangu mundomu wangu.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Chapanga wa Izilaeli akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">Litalaghu la Izilaeli akambwaghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">“Mundu paatawala bhandu ngati moipalakila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">joatawala kwa kunjoghopa Chapanga,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />jonihoju nde ngati lyobha la lukela palipita, lukela jangakubha na mahundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">ngati unang'anu baada ja iyula, ghoutenda manyonyoli kutundula kuhuma muluhombi.”<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Bhenibhela nde ntundu ambau Chapanga anaabhapengalya bhabhelakkeka bhangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">maghambu atendiki na nepani lulaghilu lwa mileli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">lulaghilu ambalu ngalwihekateke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">lulaghilu ambalu ngalwing'anambuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Ndandi ghonihoghu nde ukengaleku wangu wokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">na utokulelu wangu wokapi.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Nambu bhandu bhahakau bhokapi, nde ngati miha yeilekaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">maghambu ngacheiweza kukamulika kwa mabhoku.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Kila mundu joanakamulaje miha yeniheyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">anaimpalika kutumi choma au mpini wa nkoha. Nabhombi anabhajochakika nakanopi kwa mato.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 11:10-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Aghagha nde mahina gha bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhaka Daudi: Wa kutumbula akabhi Yoshebu Bashebeti, wa lukolu lwaka Takimoni, joakabhi chiongozi wa “Bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhatatu,” jombi akakomini kwa nkoha waki, na kubhakoma bhandu mia nane kwa chikahi chimu.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Wa kabheli akabhi Eleazali, mwana waka Dodai, wa lukolu lwaka Mwahohi. Lichobha limu Eleazali akabhi papamu na Daudi, chikahi pabhakabhi bhabhalongama Bhafilisti bhabhakabhi bhalibhongini kukomana ngondo ku Pasi Damimu hoku. Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakabhatiliki Bhafilisti. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Nambu Eleazali akajemiki kwa ukangamalu na kukomana na Bhafilisti mbaka chiwoku chaki chakatondike na kulepalela kupenda, chakahighali chikamulaki pe lipanga. Mu lichobha leniheli Bambo Chapanga akabhajangatili kuweza kukolongwa. Baada ja kuweza kunihoku, ikosi ya manjolinjoli gha Bhaizilaeli bhakakelawiki pandu paakabhi Eleazali, na kuitola hindu kuhuma kwa Bhafilisti bhabhapotile.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Nkomana ngondo mwana makili wa katatu akabhi Shama mwana waka Agee, kuhuma mu lukolu lwaka Halali. Bhafilisti bhakalibhongini ku Lehi hoku, pandu papakabhi na ngonda wa dengu yamaheli, nabhombi manjolinjoli bha Bhaizilaeli bhakabhatiliki Bhafilisti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Nambu Shama akajemiki kwa ukangamalu pachilanda ja ngonda ghonighola. Akalikomanili na kubhakoma Bhafilisti, najombi Bambo Chapanga akabhajangati kubhaweza.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Bhela, bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhatatu bhala pachilanda ja ihongozi selasini bhakahelili, na kunjende Daudi ku limbaku la ku Adulamu hoku. Chikahi chenihechi manjolinjoli gha Bhafilisti bhakabhekiki likambi labhu ku libondi la Bhalefai. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Chikahi chenihechi najombi Daudi akabhi mungomi, na manjolinjoli gha Bhafilisti ghakabhi ku muchi wa Beselehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daudi akaghatokuli machi, akapwaghike, “Ngati mundu akambeki machi gha kunywa kuhuma mu chilibha chekibhi pambipi na ndyangu ukolongwa wa muchi wa Beselehemu!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Bhakomana ngondo bhaki bhatatu bhana makili bhala, bhakalipekinyi pachilanda ja likambi la Bhafilisti, na kujenda kuteka machi mu chilibha chekibhi pambipi na Beselehemu, pambipi na ndyangu ukolongwa wa muchi, na kundetela Daudi. Nambu Daudi akakaniki kunywa machi ghanighala, akayajiti pahi nahuli kubha ngati nhupu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Akapwaghike, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, nepani ngacheimbalika kunywa machi aghagha ng'o! Bho, machi aghagha le nga ngati mwahi wa bhandu bhala bhabhahatalishi matamu ghabhu kwa kughaleta pambane?” Bhela, Daudi akakaniki kunywa machi ghanihagha. Aghagha nde mambu ghabhakahengiki bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhatatu bhala.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Bhela, Abishai ndongu waka Yoabu, mwana waka Seluya, akabhi nkolongwa bha bhakomana ngondo bhana makili selasini. Jombi akakomini kwa kutumila nkoha na bhandu mia itatu, akabhakomiki, na kulipati lujiniku pachilanda ja bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhatatu bhala. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Bho, jonihoju le ngacheakabhi na utopelu nakanopi pachilanda ja bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhatatu bhala? Bhela jonihoju akabhi nde nkomana ngondo wabhu nkolongwa, nambu ngacheakabhalangiki pachilanda ja bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhatatu bhala.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Najombi Benaya, mwana waka Yehoyada, akabhi linjolinjoli mwana makili joakahengiki mambu ghamaheli gha kukangacha namaa. Akabhakomiki bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhabheli kuhuma ku Moabu, na lichobha limu chikahi cha kuganda seluji, akajingi mulibhomba na kulikoma lihimba. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Bhelabhela akunkomiki mundu jumu ndachu nkolongwa kuhuma ku Misili. Hata ngati Mmisili hoju akabhi na nkoha mumabhoku ghaki, nambu Benaya akunjendili koni akabya na ndonga pela. Akunyawili Mmisili jola nkoha waki, na kunkoma kwa nkoha waki mweni. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Aghagha nde mambu ghaakahengiki Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, najombi akalipati lujiniku pachilanda ja bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhatatu bhala. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Bhela, jonihoju najombi akabhi na lujiniku pachilanda ja bhakomana ngondo selasini bhala, hata ngati ngacheakabhi ngati bhakomana ngondo bhana makili bhatatu bhala. Daudi akumbekiki kubha chiongozi wa bhalonda bhaki.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Pachilanda ja selasini bhala bhakabhi: Asaheli ndongu waka Yoabu, Elihanani mwana waka Dodo, kuhuma ku muchi wa Beselehemu, <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama na Elika, kuhuma mu lukolu lwaka Halodi, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helesi, kuhuma ku muchi wa Peloni, na Ila, mwana waka Ikeshi, kuhuma ku muchi wa Tekoa, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiezeli, kuhuma ku muchi wa Anasosi, na Mebunai, kuhuma mu lukolu lwaka Hushati, <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salimoni, kuhuma mu lukolu lwaka Ahohi, na Mahalai, kuhuma ku muchi wa Netofati, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Heledi, mwana waka Baana, kuhuma ku muchi wa Netofati, na Itai, mwana waka Libai, kuhuma mu likabila laka Benyamini, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya, kuhuma ku muchi wa Pilatoni, na Hidai, kuhuma ku ikoka ya Gaashi, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abialimoni, kuhuma mu lukolu lwaka Alibati, na Azimaweti, kuhuma ku muchi wa Balihumi, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliaba, kuhuma ku muchi wa Shaaliboni, na bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yasheni, Yonasani, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />mwana waka Shama, kuhuma ku muchi wa Halali, na Ahimu mwana waka Shalali, kuhuma ku muchi wa Halali, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeleti mwana waka Ahasibai, na Hefeli kuhuma ku muchi wa Maaka, na Eliamu mwana waka Ahitofeli, kuhuma ku muchi wa Giloni, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hezilo, kuhuma ku muchi wa Kalimeli, na Paalai, kuhuma ku muchi wa Alibi, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igali, mwana waka Nasani, kuhuma ku muchi wa Soba, na Bani, kuhuma mu likabila laka Gadi, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Zeleki, kuhuma kwa bhandu bhaka Amoni, Nahalai, kuhuma ku Beeloti, joakabhi mtotola wa silaha yaka Yoabu, mwana waka Seluya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ila na Gelubi, kuhuma ku muchi wa Itili, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />na Ulia, Mhiti. Bhandu bhokapi kwa papamu bhakabhi selasini na saba.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi abhabhalanga Bhaizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhayomi kabhete bhandu bha Izilaeli, najombi akunkokaki Daudi kupeleka mang'ahiku pachilanda jabhu, akapwaghaje, “Ujenda ukabhabhalanga bhandu bha Izilaeni na bhandu bha Yuda.” <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Bhela nkolongwa akumpwaghi Yoabu, papamu na manjolinjoli bhakolongwa bhaakabhi nabhu, “Njenda kwa makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli kutumbu ku muchi wa Dani mbaka ku muchi wa Beeli Sheba, mkabhabhalanga bhandu, nahuli mbata kumanya ubhalangiku wabhu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Nambu Yoabu akamyangiki nkolongwa, “Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na ajonjukya manjolinjoli mala mia kupeta mobhabheli sajenu, naghombi mihu ghaka bambo wango nkolongwa na ghabhona haleli. Nambu, maghambu kiki bambo wangu nkolongwa anyambakiki na lijambu haleli?” <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Nambu, lilobhi laka nkolongwa lakabhi na makili panani jaka Yoabu, papamu na manjolinjoli bhakolongwa bha linjolinjoli, bhela bhakabhokiki palongi jaka nkolongwa, na kujenda kubhabhalanga bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Pabhakalombwiki nkoka Yoludani, bhakabhekiki likambi labhu pambipi na Aloeli, muchi ghoubhili kunkachi ja libondi lipepandau, lelijenda ku Gadi, mbaka ku muchi wa Yezeli. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Bhela kuhuma panihapa bhakapiti mbaka ku muchi wa Gileadi, na kuhika mbaka ku muchi wa Bhahiti ku Kadeshi hoku, na kubhoke panihapa bhakajendalili mbaka ku muchi wa Dani Yaani, na kuhyongolota kujenda ku muchi wa Sidoni. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Bhela bhakabhokiki na kujenda ku ngomi ja Tilo, papamu na michi jokapi ja Bhahivi na michi ja Bhakanaani. Pakujomulela, bhakapiti ku nkachi ja Yuda, muchi ghoubhi ku Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Pabhakajomwi kupeta mu inchi jokapi, bhakakelawiki ku muchi wa Yelusalamu pajakapetiki myehi tisa na machobha ishilini. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Yoabu akabhoiki ubhalangiku wa manjolinjoli kwaka nkolongwa: Mu Izilaeli kukabhi na bhandu laki nane, bhabhakabhi na uwezu wa kukomana kwa kutumi mapanga, na mu Yuda kukabhi na bhandu laki nhwanu.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Nambu Daudi akang'ahakiki namaa muntima waki paakajomwi kubhabhalanga bhandu. Bhela, Daudi akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Nhengiki lihoku likolongwa kwa kuhenga lijambu aleli. Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, chondi nukulobha, unekakya nepani nuntumika waku, maghambu nhengiki lijambu la king'ang'a namaa.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Bhela Daudi paakajumwiki chilabhu jaki lukela, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi mlota Gadi, joakabhi mlola wa mambu ghaka Daudi, kupwagha, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Ujenda ukumpwaghila Daudi, ‘Anana nde moapwaghi Bambo Chapanga: Ananukupekya wehapa mambu ghatatu gha kuhaghula, nanau uhaghula lijambu limu laki, nanatu ananukuhengilaje.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Bhela, Gadi akunjendi Daudi, na kumpwaghila, “Bho, upala le injala ja hyaka itatu jihika mu inchi jako? Bho, au upala le wehapa ubhatila maadui bhaku kwa myehi jitatu, koni bhukujengalela? Bho, au upala le kukubha na machobha ghatatu ambapu mu inchi jaku kukubha na itamu ihakau? Bhela, uholalyaje na umbekya liyangu nahuli numpelakya jola joandumike.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Bhela, Daudi akamuyangiki Gadi, “Nyingili mu mang'ahiku makolongwa namaa! Nambu nde mbanga kulapulika na Bambo Chapanga, maghambu chihomu chaki nde chikolongwa namaa, kuliku kulapulika na bhandu.” <verse eid="2SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akabhaletili Bhaizilaeli chitamu chihakau, kutumbu lukela mbaka chikahi chechipangakike. Bhandu elufu sabini bhakapotili mu inchi jokapi kutumbu ku Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Nambu chikahi mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga paakahatambwi chiwoku chaki kujenda ku muchi wa Yelusalemu nahuli kuuyonanga, Bambo Chapanga akang'anambwi maholalelu ghaki. Chapanga akumpwaghi mtumika wa kunani joakabhi ahenga lijambu leniheli la kubhayonanga bhandu, “Ijaghanila! Ukelabhuha chiwoku chaku.” Chikahi chenihechi mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga akabhi ajemiki palubhanja lwa kupumundi mahunu lwaka Alauna, Myebusi.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Bhela Daudi paakumbweni mtumika wa kunani joakabhi abhakoma bhandu hoju, akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Lingalyaje, nepani nde nemi na mahoku na nenhokie. Bhandu abhabha bhanyengali nepani ngati mambeleleli ghaghunjengale mdima. Bho, bhahengiki kike? Chondi nukulobha unapula nepani, papamu na bhandu bha munyumba jaka tati wango.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Mu lichobha leniheli Gadi akunjendi Daudi, na kumpwaghila, “Ukwelaje, ukunchengila Bambo Chapanga pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ku chibhanja cha kupumundi mahunu ghaka Alauna, Myebusi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Bhela, Daudi akakweliki na kuhenga ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalaghalakile kupetela kwaka Gadi. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Chikahi Alauna paakalingali kumochu akumbweni nkolongwa akahikaje koni akabya na bhatumika bhake, najombi akabhokiki, na kujenda kunchikamila ukutama, akajinimi mbaka pahi paluhombe. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Panihapa Alauna akundaluki nkolongwa, “Bho, maghambu kiki bambo wangu nkolongwa anhiki nepani nuntumika wako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Daudi akayangike, “Nhikiki kuhemela lubhanja lwaku lwa kupumundila mahunu, nahuli nunchengila Bambo Chapanga pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, nahuli chitamu chechabhakamwi bhandu chabhabhokaje.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Alauna akumpwaghi Daudi, “Bambo wangu nkolongwa, utolaje chokapi chela cheubhona kubha chipalika kwa kubhokeha nhupu. Nepani anamohaje mapongu gha ng'ombi aghagha kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka, na mikongu ajeji ja kupumundila, na nila ya ng'ombi kubha hanjo.” <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Wenga nkolongwa, hindu ayeyi yokapi nepani ndenda kukupekeha. Bhelabhela Alauna akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Bambo Chapanga waku na ajopalyaje nyambiku jaku kwa wambone.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Nambu nkolongwa akumpwaghi Alauna, “Ngabhela! Wehapa ngawimbekehi chokapi chela. Nepani ananhemala kuhuma kwaku kwa samani jokapi jela. Nganumbokehi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, nyambiku ambaju ngachenijihengi chindu chokapi chela.” Bhela, nkolongwa Daudi akahemi lubhanja lwa kupumundi mahunu lola na mapongu gha ng'ombi kwa ipandi hamsini ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Bhela, Daudi akunchengi Bambo Chapanga pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, na nhupu ya kutama kwa lukwale pandu panihapa. Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akaghajetakili malobhu kwa ndandi ja inchi, na chitamu chihakau chechakabhapatiki Bhaizilaeli chela chakabhabhokike.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>